        km\n                                        </span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"text-right\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"last visit section\">\n                                    <div class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"last visit label\">\n                                        Última visita\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"last visit date\">\n                                        02 jun 2026\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <button class=\"mt-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-1-3\" data-name=\"view link\">\n                                Ver ficha\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"link arrow icon\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n                            </button>\n                        </article>\n                        <article class=\"border border-dashed border-[#475569] bg-[#111C2D] p-5\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"incomplete vehicle card\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"incomplete card header\">\n                                <div data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"incomplete title section\">\n                                    <div class=\"mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#FBBF24]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"incomplete status label\">\n                                        <span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#FBBF24]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"status circle\">\n                                        </span>\n                                        Sin datos recientes\n                                    </div>\n                                    <h2 class=\"[font-family:'Plus_Jakarta_Sans',sans-serif] text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.035em] text-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"vehicle model\">\n                                        Renault Duster 2021\n                                    </h2>\n                                    <div class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"vehicle license plate\">\n                                        J 204-118\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-file-alert text-[20px] text-[#FBBF24]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"warning icon\" style=\"width:20px;height:20px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-5 border-t border-[#334155] pt-4 text-[12px] leading-5 text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"incomplete description\">\n                                Completa la ficha para activar recordatorios de kilometraje y vencimientos.\n                            </div>\n                            <button class=\"mt-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#FBBF24]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-3\" data-name=\"complete ficha button\">\n                                Completar ficha\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"link arrow icon\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n                            </button>\n                        </article>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n                <div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-[#334155] pt-5\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4\" data-name=\"alert prompt bar\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[12px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"alert prompt message\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-info-circle text-[16px] text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"info icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                        <span data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"alert text\">\n                            ¿Tienes otro vehículo? Agrégalo para recibir alertas de mantenimiento.\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <button class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2\" data-name=\"manage alerts link\">\n                        Administrar alertas\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right ml-1 text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"link arrow icon\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n                <footer class=\"mt-7 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-[#334155] pt-4 text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-5\" data-name=\"page footer\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-5-1\" data-name=\"copyright/brand name\">\n                        AutoDoc · Diagnóstico y mantenimiento para tu vehículo\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-5-2\" data-name=\"sync status section\" data-reason=\"sync status updated by script\">\n                        <span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"sync indicator icon\">\n                        </span>\n                        Datos sincronizados hace 4 min\n                    </span>\n                </footer>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
