                          <div class=\"font-semibold text-[#E2E8F0]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-4-2\" data-name=\"logs cell actor 3\">\n                                Superadmin\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-4-3\" data-name=\"logs cell event 3\">\n                                Bloqueó una cuenta sospechosa\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 font-semibold text-[#FCA5A5]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-4-4\" data-name=\"logs cell status 3\">\n                                <span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#F87171]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-4-4-1\" data-name=\"status indicator 3\">\n                                </span>\n                                Crítico\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n                <footer class=\"mt-9 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-[#334155] pt-5 text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-5\" data-name=\"footer\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-5-1\" data-name=\"footer copyright text\">\n                        AutoDoc · Consola de administración\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-5-2\" data-name=\"sync status container\">\n                        <span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"sync status indicator\">\n                        </span>\n                        Datos sincronizados hace 2 min\n                    </span>\n                </footer>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
