" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"workshop reply and quote group\">\n                        <span class=\"grid size-8 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#DBEAFE] text-[10px] font-bold text-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3-2\">\n                            TR\n                        </span>\n                        <div class=\"max-w-[520px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3-3\">\n                            <p class=\"mb-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#64748B]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"workshop reply timestamp\" data-reason=\"text dynamic based on message metadata\">\n                                Taller Rápido · 09:40\n                            </p>\n                            <div class=\"border border-[#CBD5E1] bg-white px-4 py-3.5 text-[14px] leading-6 text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3-3-2\">\n                                Aproximadamente 45 minutos. Te comparto la cotización.\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-3 rounded-[16px] border border-l-4 border-[#1E88E5] bg-[#EEEDF0] px-5 py-4 shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(15,23,42,0.04)]\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"service quote card with updated styling\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3-1-2\">\n                                    <div data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3-1-2-1\">\n                                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3-1-2-1-1\">\n                                            <span class=\"text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3-1-2-1-1-1\">\n                                                <i class=\"ti ti-file-invoice\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3-1-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"file invoice icon\" style=\"width:15px;height:15px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#1E88E5\">\n                                                </i>\n                                            </span>\n                                            Cotización de servicio\n                                        </div>\n                                        <h3 class=\"mt-2 font-heading text-[16px] font-bold text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3-1-2-1-2\">\n                                            Cambio de pastillas\n                                        </h3>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <span class=\"border border-[#FDE68A] bg-[#FFFBEB] px-2 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold text-[#92400E]\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3-1-2-2\">\n                                        Pendiente\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-4 flex items-end justify-between border-t border-[#E2E8F0] pt-3\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3-1-3\">\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-5 text-[12px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3-1-3-1\">\n                                        <span data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3-1-3-1-1\">\n                                            <strong class=\"font-semibold text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3-1-3-1-1-1\">\n                                                $180.00\n                                            </strong>\n                                        </span>\n                                        <span data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3-1-3-1-2\">\n                                            45 min\n                                        </span>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <button class=\"flex h-9 items-center gap-2 border border-[#1E88E5] px-3 text-[12px] font-bold text-[#1E88E5] hover:bg-[#E8F2FD]\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"view reservation button\">\n                                        Ver reserva\n                                        <span class=\"text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3-1-1-1\">\n                                            <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-3-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"arrow-up-right icon\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#1E88E5\">\n                                            </i>\n                                        </span>\n                                    </button>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex justify-end\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-4\" data-name=\"owner acknowledgement message\">\n                        <div class=\"max-w-[330px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-4-1\">\n                            <p class=\"mb-1.5 text-right text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#64748B]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"owner message timestamp\" data-reason=\"text dynamic based on message metadata\">\n                                Tú · 09:42\n                            </p>\n                            <div class=\"border border-[#BFDBFE] bg-[#DBEAFE] px-4 py-3.5 text-[14px] leading-6 text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-4-1-2\">\n                                Perfecto, la reviso y te confirmo en un momento.\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1.5 text-right text-[10px] font-medium text-[#10B981]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1-2-4-1-3\" data-name=\"message delivery status\" data-reason=\"text toggled between 'Entregado'/'Leído' by status update\">\n                                Entregado\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <footer class=\"shrink-0 border-t border-[#CBD5E1] bg-white px-8 py-4\" data-kid=\"2-3-3\" data-name=\"message composer footer\">\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[720px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"message composer container\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border border-[#CBD5E1] bg-white p-2 focus-within:border-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-1\" data-name=\"message composer input shell\">\n                    <button aria-label=\"Adjuntar archivo\" class=\"grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center text-[18px] text-[#64748B] hover:bg-[#F8FAFC] hover:text-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"attach file button\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[18px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-1-1-1\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-paperclip\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"paperclip icon\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#64748B\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                    </button>\n                    <span class=\"grid size-9 shrink-0 place-items-center text-[18px] text-[#64748B] hover:bg-[#F8FAFC] hover:text-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"emoji button\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[18px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-1-2-1\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-mood-smile\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"smiley face icon\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#64748B\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                    </span>\n                    <div aria-label=\"Escribe un mensaje\" class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 px-2 text-[14px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-1-3\" data-name=\"message text input\" role=\"textbox\">\n                        Escribe un mensaje\n                    </div>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Enviar mensaje\" class=\"flex min-h-[48px] items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#522C81] to-[#45256D] px-5 py-3 text-[12px] font-bold text-white shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(15,23,42,0.05)] transition duration-150 ease-out hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-[0_6px_14px_rgba(15,23,42,0.12)] active:scale-[0.97]\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-1-4\" data-name=\"send message button\">\n                        Enviar\n                        <span class=\"text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-1-4-1\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-send\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"send icon\" style=\"width:15px;height:15px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#FFFFFF\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"mt-2 text-[10px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1-2\">\n                    Taller Rápido responde normalmente en menos de 10 minutos.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n    </main>\n</div>\n",
