      "html": "<link data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"google font stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont/tabler-icons.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@600;700;800&display=swap');\n  .font-heading { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; }\n  .font-body { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; }\n  .technical-octagon { clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 88% 14%, 100% 50%, 88% 86%, 50% 100%, 12% 86%, 0% 50%, 12% 14%); }\n</style>\n<div class=\"font-body min-h-screen bg-[#F8FAFC] text-[#0F172A] antialiased\" data-kid=\"2\" data-name=\"onboarding screen container\">\n    <header class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 z-20 flex items-center justify-between px-10 py-8\" data-kid=\"2-1\" data-name=\"onboarding header\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-1-1\" data-name=\"brand lockup\">\n            <div aria-label=\"AutoDoc\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-[#1E88E5] text-[17px] font-heading font-extrabold tracking-[-0.09em] text-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"AutoDoc logo mark\">\n                AD\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"font-heading text-[17px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.04em] text-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"AutoDoc wordmark\">\n                AutoDoc\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[12px] font-semibold tracking-[0.08em] text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2\" data-name=\"onboarding product label\">\n            <span class=\"size-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#B87333]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"copper status dot\">\n            </span>\n            CUIDADO VEHICULAR\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <main class=\"grid min-h-screen lg:grid-cols-[1.08fr_0.92fr]\" data-kid=\"2-2\" data-name=\"onboarding split layout\">\n        <section class=\"relative min-h-[520px] overflow-hidden bg-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1\" data-name=\"onboarding visual panel\">\n            <img alt=\"Sedán Hyundai en perfil durante una revisión visual, fotografía de Hyundai Motor Group en Pexels\" class=\"h-full min-h-[520px] w-full object-cover opacity-90\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"vehicle maintenance image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/14696345/pexels-photo-14696345.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200&q=80\"/>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[#0F172A]/45\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"solid image contrast layer\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"absolute left-10 top-32 h-[360px] w-px bg-[#CBD5E1]/45\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"technical vertical line\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"absolute left-[34px] top-[300px] size-3 rounded-full border-2 border-[#38BDF8] bg-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-4\" data-name=\"technical line marker\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"absolute right-12 top-36 size-28 border border-[#B87333]/70 technical-octagon\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-5\" data-name=\"technical octagon outline\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"absolute right-[84px] top-[226px] h-px w-20 bg-[#B87333]/70\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-6\" data-name=\"technical horizontal line\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-10 left-10 right-10 flex items-end justify-between gap-8\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-7\" data-name=\"visual panel metadata\">\n                <div data-kid=\"2-2-1-7-1\" data-name=\"technical annotation\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-7-1-1\" data-name=\"annotation label\">\n                        LECTURA TÉCNICA\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-2 font-heading text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-7-1-2\" data-name=\"annotation title\">\n                        Motor y frenos\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-7-1-3\" data-name=\"annotation description\">\n                        Una vista clara antes de salir.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"border-l border-[#CBD5E1]/50 pl-5 text-right\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-7-2\" data-name=\"technical metrics\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-7-2-1\" data-name=\"metric label\">\n                        SISTEMAS\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-1 font-heading text-[24px] font-bold tabular-nums text-white\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-7-2-2\" data-name=\"metric value\">\n                        02 / 08\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"relative flex min-h-[520px] flex-col justify-between bg-[#F8FAFC] px-10 pb-10 pt-36 lg:px-20\" data-kid=\"2-2-2\" data-name=\"onboarding content panel\">\n            <div data-kid=\"2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"onboarding copy group\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"step counter group\">\n                    <span class=\"font-heading text-[12px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.16em] text-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"step counter\">\n                        01 / 03\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"h-px w-12 bg-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"step divider\">\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"text-[12px] font-medium text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"step context\">\n                        INICIO\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <h1 class=\"mt-8 max-w-[470px] font-heading text-[44px] font-extrabold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.055em] text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"onboarding title\">\n                    Tu vehículo,\n                    <br data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"title line break\"/>\n                    en control.\n                </h1>\n                <p class=\"mt-7 max-w-[430px] text-[17px] leading-7 text-[#475569]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"onboarding description\">\n                    Registra el estado de tu auto y recibe recordatorios antes de que una reparación se vuelva urgente.\n                </p>\n                <div aria-label=\"Progreso del onboarding: paso 1 de 3\" class=\"mt-9 flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4\" data-name=\"pagination indicators\">\n                    <span class=\"h-2.5 w-12 bg-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"active progress segment\">\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 border border-[#94A3B8] bg-transparent\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"inactive progress marker\">\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 border border-[#94A3B8] bg-transparent\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4-3\" data-name=\"inactive progress marker\">\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"ml-2 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4-4\" data-name=\"progress text\">\n                        1 de 3\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-12\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"onboarding actions\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"primary action row\">\n                    <button aria-label=\"Siguiente: continuar al segundo paso\" class=\"inline-flex min-h-[56px] items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#522C81] to-[#46246F] px-7 text-[14px] font-bold text-white shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] transition duration-150 ease-out hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-[0_6px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.10)] active:scale-[0.97]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"next button\">\n                        Siguiente\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right text-[18px]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"next arrow icon\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Omitir onboarding y continuar al inicio de sesión\" class=\"inline-flex min-h-[48px] items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#CBD5E1] bg-[#EEEDF0] px-5 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#5B6B80] shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] transition duration-150 ease-out hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-[0_6px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.10)] active:scale-[0.97]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"skip action button\">\n                        Omitir\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-8 flex max-w-[450px] items-start gap-3 rounded-[16px] border border-[#CBD5E1]/40 bg-[#EEEDF0] px-4 py-4 shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"onboarding reassurance note container\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-shield-check text-[19px] text-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"trust icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                    <p class=\"text-[12px] leading-5 text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"trust note\">\n                        Tus datos quedan organizados para que puedas actuar a tiempo, con menos sorpresas en el taller.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-10 right-10 hidden text-right lg:block\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"onboarding footer mark\">\n                <p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"footer label\">\n                    AUTODOC / 2026\n                </p>\n                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"footer description\">\n                    Diagnóstico y mantenimiento vehicular\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-08-15T15:37:02.361285+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-08-17T21:03:08.411260+00:00",
      "id": "var_8b90c65cb64d"
    },
    "var_c49a9d1e51c7": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "AutoDoc Auth — Hadrian Light",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 24115,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1280,
        "h": 800
      },
      "html": "<link data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"Google Fonts stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont/tabler-icons.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@600;700;800&display=swap');\n  .font-heading { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; }\n  .font-body { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"font-body min-h-screen bg-[#F8FAFC] text-[#0F172A] antialiased\" data-kid=\"2\" data-name=\"Auth page root\">\n    <div class=\"grid min-h-screen lg:grid-cols-[43%_57%]\" data-kid=\"2-1\" data-name=\"Two-zone authentication layout\">\n        <section class=\"relative hidden min-h-screen overflow-hidden bg-[#0F172A] text-white lg:block\" data-kid=\"2-1-1\" data-name=\"Graphite brand panel\">\n            <img alt=\"Sedán moderno en un estudio oscuro, fotografía de Hyundai Motor Group en Pexels\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-45\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"Automotive brand image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/14696345/pexels-photo-14696345.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200&q=80\"/>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0F172A]/90 via-[#0F172A]/55 to-[#020617]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"Brand panel tonal overlay\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"relative flex min-h-screen flex-col justify-between px-12 py-11\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"Brand panel content\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"Brand header\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"AutoDoc logo group\">\n                        <div aria-label=\"AutoDoc\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-[12px] bg-[#1E88E5] text-[18px] font-heading font-extrabold tracking-[-0.08em] text-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"AutoDoc logo mark\">\n                            AD\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"font-heading text-[18px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.04em]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"AutoDoc wordmark\">\n                            AutoDoc\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"Brand environment label\">\n                        Mantenimiento vehicular\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"max-w-[420px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"Brand promise block\">\n                    <div class=\"mb-5 flex items-center gap-3 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#7DD3FC]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"Brand eyebrow\">\n                        <span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"Eyebrow rule\">\n                        </span>\n                        Tu vehículo, en control\n                    </div>\n                    <h1 class=\"font-heading text-[42px] font-extrabold leading-[1.08] tracking-[-0.055em] text-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"Brand promise heading\">\n                        Mantenimiento claro.\n                        <br data-kid=\"2-1-1-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Brand promise heading line break\"/>\n                        Decisiones seguras.\n                    </h1>\n                    <p class=\"mt-6 max-w-[360px] text-[15px] leading-7 text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"Brand promise description\">\n                        Conoce el estado real de tus vehículos, encuentra talleres confiables y actúa antes de que un detalle se convierta en una reparación.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-end justify-between gap-6\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-3-3\" data-name=\"Brand footer\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[12px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"Safety statement\">\n                        <span class=\"grid size-8 place-items-center border border-[#475569] text-[17px] text-[#7DD3FC]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-3-3-1-1\" data-name=\"Safety icon container\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-shield-check\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-3-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"Safety shield icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                        Datos de tu garaje protegidos\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-3-3-2\" data-name=\"Brand version text\">\n                        AutoDoc · 2026\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <main class=\"flex min-h-screen flex-col\" data-kid=\"2-1-2\" data-name=\"Authentication form panel\">\n            <header class=\"flex h-[76px] items-center justify-between border-b border-[#E2E8F0] bg-white px-6 sm:px-10\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"Auth top bar\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 lg:hidden\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"Mobile brand group\">\n                    <div aria-label=\"AutoDoc\" class=\"grid size-9 place-items-center rounded-[10px] bg-[#1E88E5] text-[15px] font-heading font-extrabold tracking-[-0.08em] text-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"Mobile logo mark\">\n                        AD\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"font-heading text-[16px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.04em]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"Mobile wordmark\">\n                        AutoDoc\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"hidden text-[12px] text-[#64748B] lg:block\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"Auth context text\">\n                    Acceso seguro a tu garaje\n                </div>\n                <button aria-label=\"Cambiar idioma\" class=\"ml-auto flex min-h-12 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#CBD5E1] bg-[#EEEDF0] px-4 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#5B6B80] shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] transition duration-150 ease-out hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-[0_6px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.10)] active:scale-[0.97]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"language selector button\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"Language icon container\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-language\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"Language icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </span>\n                    ES\n                    <span class=\"text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"Language chevron container\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-chevron-down\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"Language chevron icon\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </span>\n                </button>\n            </header>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-center px-6 py-10 sm:px-10 lg:px-16\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"Auth form content wrapper\">\n                <section aria-labelledby=\"auth-heading\" class=\"w-full max-w-[420px] rounded-[16px] border border-[#CBD5E1]/40 bg-[#EEEDF0] p-6 shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"login form card container\">\n                    <div class=\"mb-8\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"Auth heading group\">\n                        <div class=\"mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"Auth eyebrow\">\n                            <span class=\"size-2 rounded-full bg-[#10B981]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"Connection status dot\">\n                            </span>\n                            Acceso disponible\n                        </div>\n                        <h2 class=\"font-heading text-[32px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.05em] text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"Auth heading\" id=\"auth-heading\">\n                            Bienvenido a AutoDoc\n                        </h2>\n                        <p class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] leading-6 text-[#475569]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"Auth description\">\n                            Accede para ver el estado de tus vehículos y tus servicios.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <form class=\"space-y-5\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"Login form\">\n                        <label class=\"block\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"Email field group\">\n                            <span class=\"mb-2 block text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"Email field label\">\n                                Correo electrónico\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"flex min-h-14 items-center gap-3 border border-[#CBD5E1] bg-white px-4 focus-within:border-[#1E88E5] focus-within:ring-2 focus-within:ring-[#1E88E5]/20\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"Email field surface\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[19px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"Email icon container\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-mail\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"Email icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </span>\n                                <input aria-label=\"Correo electrónico\" class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 border-0 bg-transparent text-[15px] text-[#0F172A] outline-hidden placeholder:text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"Email input\" placeholder=\"tu@correo.com\" type=\"email\" value=\"juan@ejemplo.com\"/>\n                            </span>\n                        </label>\n                        <label class=\"block\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"Password field group\">\n                            <span class=\"mb-2 block text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Password field label\">\n                                Contraseña\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"flex min-h-14 items-center gap-3 border border-[#EF4444] bg-white px-4 ring-2 ring-[#EF4444]/10 focus-within:border-[#1E88E5] focus-within:ring-2 focus-within:ring-[#1E88E5]/20\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"Password field error surface\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[19px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Password icon container\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-lock\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"Password icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </span>\n                                <input aria-label=\"Contraseña\" class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 border-0 bg-transparent text-[15px] text-[#0F172A] outline-hidden placeholder:text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"Password input\" placeholder=\"Introduce tu contraseña\" type=\"password\" value=\"incorrecta\"/>\n                                <button aria-label=\"Mostrar contraseña\" class=\"grid size-12 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[#CBD5E1] bg-[#EEEDF0] text-[18px] text-[#5B6B80] shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] transition duration-150 ease-out hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-[0_6px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.10)] active:scale-[0.97]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"password visibility button\" type=\"button\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-eye\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"Password visibility icon\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </button>\n                            </span>\n                        </label>\n                        <div class=\"flex min-h-12 items-center justify-between gap-4\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"Auth options row\">\n                            <label class=\"flex min-h-12 items-center gap-2 text-[13px] text-[#475569]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"Remember me option\">\n                                <input checked=\"\" class=\"size-4 accent-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"Remember me checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>\n                                Recordarme\n                            </label>\n                            <button class=\"min-h-12 px-1 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#1E88E5] underline-offset-4 hover:underline\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-3-2\" data-name=\"Forgot password button\" type=\"button\">\n                                ¿Olvidaste tu contraseña?\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 border-l-4 border-[#EF4444] bg-[#FEF2F2] px-4 py-3\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-4\" data-name=\"Inline authentication error\" role=\"alert\">\n                            <span class=\"mt-0.5 text-[19px] text-[#DC2626]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"Error icon container\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-alert-triangle\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"Error alert icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n                            </span>\n                            <div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"Error copy group\">\n                                <p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold text-[#991B1B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"Error title\">\n                                    No pudimos iniciar sesión\n                                </p>\n                                <p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[12px] leading-5 text-[#7F1D1D]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"Error message\">\n                                    Revisa tu correo y contraseña\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <button class=\"flex min-h-14 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#522C81] to-[#46246F] px-5 text-[14px] font-bold text-white shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] transition duration-150 ease-out hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-[0_6px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.10)] active:scale-[0.97] focus:outline-2 focus:outline-offset-2 focus:outline-[#522C81]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-5\" data-name=\"primary login button\" type=\"submit\">\n                            Iniciar sesión\n                            <span class=\"text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"Login arrow container\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"Login arrow icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n                            </span>\n                        </button>\n                    </form>\n                    <div class=\"my-7 flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"Auth divider\">\n                        <span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-[#E2E8F0]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"Divider line left\">\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"Divider label\">\n                            o\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-[#E2E8F0]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-3-3\" data-name=\"Divider line right\">\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <button class=\"flex min-h-14 w-full items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-[#CBD5E1] bg-[#EEEDF0] px-5 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#0F172A] shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] transition duration-150 ease-out hover:scale-[1.02] hover:border-[#522C81] hover:shadow-[0_6px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.10)] active:scale-[0.97] focus:outline-2 focus:outline-offset-2 focus:outline-[#522C81]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-4\" data-name=\"Google sign in button\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[19px] text-[#4285F4]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"Google icon container\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-brand-google\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"Google icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                        Continuar con Google\n                    </button>\n                    <p class=\"mt-8 text-center text-[13px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-5\" data-name=\"Auth mode switch copy\">\n                        ¿No tienes cuenta?\n                        <button class=\"ml-1 min-h-12 px-1 font-semibold text-[#1E88E5] underline-offset-4 hover:underline\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-5-1\" data-name=\"Create account button\">\n                            Crear cuenta\n                        </button>\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-8 text-center text-[11px] leading-5 text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-6\" data-name=\"Auth legal copy\">\n                        Al continuar, aceptas los términos de uso y la política de privacidad de AutoDoc.\n                    </p>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
