=\"font-heading text-[16px] font-bold text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-2-2-2\">\n                                    Pastillas de freno próximas\n                                </h3>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] text-[#475569]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-2-2-3\">\n                                    Toyota Corolla 2022\n                                    <span class=\"text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-2-2-3-1\">\n                                        ·\n                                    </span>\n                                    P 482-916\n                                </p>\n                                <p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-[#92400E]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-2-2-4\">\n                                    Revisar en\n                                    <strong class=\"font-bold tabular-nums\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"preventive alert mileage indicator\" data-reason=\"mileage value updated from vehicle data\">\n                                        420 km\n                                    </strong>\n                                    .\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"text-right\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-2-3\">\n                                <p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-2-3-1\">\n                                    Próximo paso\n                                </p>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#475569]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-2-3-2\">\n                                    Servicio preventivo\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <button class=\"flex min-h-[48px] items-center justify-center gap-2 justify-self-end rounded-full border border-[#C17817]/60 bg-[#FFF7E6] px-4 py-3 text-[12px] font-bold text-[#92400E] shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(15,23,42,0.05)] transition duration-150 ease-out hover:bg-[#FDECC8] hover:shadow-[0_6px_14px_rgba(15,23,42,0.10)] active:scale-[0.97]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-2-4\" data-name=\"preventive alert action button\">\n                                Agendar servicio\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-calendar-plus ml-1\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-2-4-1\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n                            </button>\n                        </article>\n                        <article class=\"grid grid-cols-[48px_minmax(0,1fr)_150px_140px] items-center gap-5 border-l-4 border-l-[#1E88E5] px-5 py-5\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-3\" data-name=\"informational profile alert row\">\n                            <div class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#E8F2FD] text-[20px] text-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-3-1\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-info-circle\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-3-1-1\" style=\"width:20px;height:20px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n                            </div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-3-2\">\n                                <div class=\"mb-1 flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-3-2-1\">\n                                    <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[#176FBB]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-3-2-1-1\">\n                                        Informativa\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"size-1 rounded-full bg-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-3-2-1-2\">\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-3-2-1-3\">\n                                        Hace 2 días\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                                <h3 class=\"font-heading text-[16px] font-bold text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-3-2-2\">\n                                    Perfil de vehículo incompleto\n                                </h3>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] text-[#475569]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-3-2-3\">\n                                    Renault Duster 2021\n                                    <span class=\"text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-3-2-3-1\">\n                                        ·\n                                    </span>\n                                    J 204-118\n                                </p>\n                                <p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-[#1D4ED8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-3-2-4\">\n                                    Completa la ficha para activar recordatorios de mantenimiento.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"text-right\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-3-3\">\n                                <p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-3-3-1\">\n                                    Recomendación\n                                </p>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#475569]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-3-3-2\">\n                                    Añadir kilometraje\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <button class=\"flex min-h-[48px] items-center justify-center gap-2 justify-self-end rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#522C81] to-[#45236F] px-4 py-3 text-[12px] font-bold text-white shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(15,23,42,0.05)] transition duration-150 ease-out hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-[0_6px_14px_rgba(15,23,42,0.10)] active:scale-[0.97]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-3-4\" data-name=\"informational alert action button\">\n                                Completar ficha\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right ml-1\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-3-4-1\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n                            </button>\n                        </article>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n                <div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-[#CBD5E1] pt-4\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4\" data-name=\"alerts sync footer\">\n                    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px] text-[#64748B]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-1\" data-name=\"sync status text\" data-reason=\"relative time timestamp updated periodically\">\n                        <span class=\"size-2 rounded-full bg-[#10B981]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-1-1\">\n                        </span>\n                        Última sincronización hace 8 min\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"text-[12px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2\">\n                        Los estados se actualizan con el kilometraje registrado.\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"mt-7 pb-2 text-[11px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-5\" data-name=\"footer copyright\">\n                    AutoDoc · Diagnóstico y mantenimiento vehicular · Datos sincronizados con tu garaje\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-08-15T15:37:04.798089+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-08-17T21:14:33.191467+00:00",
      "id": "var_7b8571875dd5"
    },
    "var_cfd1fa53c708": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "AutoDoc Onboarding — Hadrian Dark",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 33390,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1280,
        "h": 800
      },
      "html": "<link data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"Google Fonts stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont/tabler-icons.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@600;700;800&display=swap');\n  .font-heading { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; }\n  .font-body { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"font-body min-h-screen bg-[#0F172A] text-[#F8FAFC] antialiased\" data-kid=\"2\" data-name=\"Onboarding dark root\">\n    <header class=\"flex h-[84px] items-center justify-between border-b border-[#334155] bg-[#020617] px-12\" data-kid=\"2-1\" data-name=\"Onboarding top bar\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-1-1\" data-name=\"AutoDoc brand group\">\n            <div aria-label=\"AutoDoc\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center rounded-[11px] bg-[#38BDF8] text-[16px] font-heading font-extrabold tracking-[-0.08em] text-[#082F49]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"AutoDoc logo mark\">\n                AD\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"font-heading text-[18px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.045em]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"AutoDoc wordmark\">\n                Auto\n                <span class=\"text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"AutoDoc wordmark suffix\">\n                    Doc\n                </span>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"size-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"brand status dot\">\n            </span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"2-1-2\" data-name=\"Onboarding progress header\">\n            <span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"onboarding label\">\n                Configuración inicial\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"h-4 w-px bg-[#334155]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"progress separator\">\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"font-heading text-[13px] font-bold tabular-nums text-[#E2E8F0]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"slide count\">\n                01\n                <span class=\"text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"slide total\">\n                    / 03\n                </span>\n            </span>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <main class=\"flex min-h-[calc(100vh-84px)]\" data-kid=\"2-2\" data-name=\"Onboarding split layout\">\n        <section class=\"relative flex w-[56%] flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden border-r border-[#334155] bg-[#0B1220] px-12 py-10\" data-kid=\"2-2-1\" data-name=\"Automotive visual panel\">\n            <div class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 h-full w-[52px] border-r border-[#1E293B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"Technical side rail\">\n                <div class=\"flex h-full flex-col items-center justify-between py-8\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"Technical rail contents\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#64748B] [writing-mode:vertical-rl]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"rail label\">\n                        AUTODOC / SYSTEM 01\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[#475569] [writing-mode:vertical-rl]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"rail coordinate\">\n                        04.82 · 01.03\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 ml-16 flex items-start justify-between\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"Visual panel header\">\n                <div data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-4\" data-name=\"Visual panel header text group\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"visual kicker\">\n                        Vehicle care / first scan\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-2 text-[12px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"visual descriptor\">\n                        Una lectura clara empieza con tu garaje.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div aria-label=\"Indicador técnico octagonal\" class=\"grid size-14 place-items-center bg-[#B87333] text-[#0F172A] [clip-path:polygon(50%_0%,85%_15%,100%_50%,85%_85%,50%_100%,15%_85%,0%_50%,15%_15%)]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"copper octagon indicator\">\n                    <div class=\"grid size-9 place-items-center border border-[#0F172A] [clip-path:polygon(50%_0%,85%_15%,100%_50%,85%_85%,50%_100%,15%_85%,0%_50%,15%_15%)]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"octagon inner mark\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold tabular-nums\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"octagon index number\">\n                            01\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 ml-16 mt-8 flex min-h-[438px] flex-1 items-center justify-center border border-[#334155] bg-[#020617]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"Automotive image stage\">\n                <div class=\"absolute left-5 top-5 h-10 w-10 border-l border-t border-[#38BDF8]/60\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"technical corner top left\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"absolute bottom-5 right-5 h-10 w-10 border-b border-r border-[#38BDF8]/60\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"technical corner bottom right\">\n                </div>\n                <img alt=\"Sedán Hyundai en un estudio oscuro, fotografía de Hyundai Motor Group en Pexels\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover opacity-80\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-3-3\" data-name=\"onboarding vehicle image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/14696345/pexels-photo-14696345.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200&q=80\"/>\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 flex items-end justify-between border-t border-[#334155] bg-[#020617]/90 px-6 py-5\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-3-4\" data-name=\"image technical caption\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"2-2-1-3-4-4\" data-name=\"image technical caption text group\">\n                        <div class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-3-4-1\" data-name=\"image caption kicker\">\n                            Diagnóstico en tiempo real\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-1 font-heading text-[16px] font-bold text-[#E2E8F0]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-3-4-2\" data-name=\"image caption title\">\n                            Tu vehículo, en control.\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-3-4-3\" data-name=\"visual status\">\n                        <span class=\"size-2 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-3-4-3-1\" data-name=\"ready status dot\">\n                        </span>\n                        Sistema listo\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"relative z-10 ml-16 mt-5 flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-4\" data-name=\"visual panel footer\">\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#475569]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"visual footer code\">\n                    AUTODOC / 2026\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"text-[11px] tabular-nums text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"visual footer detail\">\n                    01 — 03\n                </span>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"flex w-[44%] flex-col justify-between bg-[#020617] px-16 py-12\" data-kid=\"2-2-2\" data-name=\"Onboarding copy panel\">\n            <div data-kid=\"2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Copy panel top content\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"step label\">\n                    <span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"step marker line\">\n                    </span>\n                    Paso 01 / Diagnóstico\n                </div>\n                <h1 class=\"mt-10 max-w-[430px] font-heading text-[46px] font-extrabold leading-[1.06] tracking-[-0.06em] text-[#F8FAFC]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"onboarding headline\">\n                    Tu vehículo,\n                    <br data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"onboarding headline break\"/>\n                    <span class=\"text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"onboarding headline highlight\">\n                        en control.\n                    </span>\n                </h1>\n                <p class=\"mt-7 max-w-[410px] text-[17px] leading-8 text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"onboarding description\">\n                    Registra el estado de tu auto y recibe recordatorios antes de que una reparación se vuelva urgente.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"mt-10 overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-[#334155]/20 bg-[#141E36] p-2 shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4\" data-name=\"onboarding value list container\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 border-b border-[#1E293B] py-4\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"value item one\">\n                        <span class=\"grid size-9 place-items-center border border-[#334155] text-[17px] text-[#34D399]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"value icon one\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-steering-wheel\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"steering wheel icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                        <div data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4-1-2\" data-name=\"value item one text group\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#E2E8F0]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"value item one title\">\n                                Conoce tu auto\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"value item one description\">\n                                Datos útiles, no suposiciones.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 border-b border-[#1E293B] py-4\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"value item two\">\n                        <span class=\"grid size-9 place-items-center border border-[#334155] text-[17px] text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"value icon two\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-chart-line\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"chart line icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                        <div data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"value item two text group\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#E2E8F0]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"value item two title\">\n                                Anticípate al desgaste\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"value item two description\">\n                                Recordatorios a tiempo.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 py-4\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4-3\" data-name=\"value item three\">\n                        <span class=\"grid size-9 place-items-center border border-[#334155] text-[17px] text-[#B87333]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4-3-1\" data-name=\"value icon three\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-alert-triangle\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4-3-1-1\" data-name=\"alert triangle icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                        <div data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4-3-2\" data-name=\"value item three text group\">\n                            <p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#E2E8F0]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4-3-2-1\" data-name=\"value item three title\">\n                                Actúa con confianza\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4-3-2-2\" data-name=\"value item three description\">\n                                Cada alerta tiene un siguiente paso.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div data-kid=\"2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"Onboarding actions block\">\n                <div class=\"mb-7\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Accessible pager\">\n                    <div class=\"mb-3 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"pager labels\">\n                        <span data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"pager current step text\">\n                            Paso 1 de 3\n                        </span>\n                        <span data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"pager current activity text\">\n                            Diagnóstico\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div aria-label=\"Progreso del onboarding: paso 1 de 3\" class=\"flex gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"pager track\">\n                        <span class=\"h-1.5 flex-1 bg-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"active pager segment\">\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"h-1.5 flex-1 bg-[#334155]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"inactive pager segment\">\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"h-1.5 flex-1 bg-[#334155]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"inactive pager segment\">\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-6\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"onboarding action row\">\n                    <button class=\"inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#334155] bg-[#141E36] px-5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#CBD5E1] shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] transition duration-150 ease-out hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-[0_6px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.35)] active:scale-[0.97]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"skip onboarding button\">\n                        Omitir\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"flex min-h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#81E6D9] to-[#6FC8BC] px-6 text-[13px] font-bold text-[#0F172A] shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] transition duration-150 ease-out hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-[0_6px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.35)] active:scale-[0.97]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"next onboarding button\">\n                        Siguiente\n                        <span class=\"text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"next arrow icon container\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"arrow right icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-08-15T15:37:04.983085+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-08-17T21:03:22.476870+00:00",
      "id": "var_cfd1fa53c708"
    },
    "var_882de3ea92c2": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "AutoDoc Workshop Directory — Hadrian Dark",
      "parentId": null,
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 35245,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1280,
        "h": 800
      },
      "html": "<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@600;700;800&display=swap');\n    aside button { min-width: 44px; min-height: 44px; border: 1px solid rgba(51,65,85,.2); border-radius: 9999px; background: #141E36; box-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.2); transition: transform 150ms cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1), background-color 150ms cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1), box-shadow 150ms cubic-bezier(.23,1,.32,1); }\n    aside button:hover { background: #1E293B; box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.35); }\n    aside button:active { transform: scale(.97); }\n    aside button[class*=\"bg-[#1E293B]\"] { background: #1E293B; border-color: #38BDF8; color: #38BDF8; }\n</style>\n<link data-kid=\"1\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont/tabler-icons.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#0F172A] text-[#F8FAFC] antialiased [font-family:'IBM_Plex_Sans',sans-serif]\" data-kid=\"2\" data-name=\"Workshop directory application\">\n    <div class=\"flex min-h-screen\" data-kid=\"2-1\" data-name=\"Application shell\">\n        <aside class=\"flex w-[72px] shrink-0 flex-col items-center justify-between border-r border-[#334155] bg-[#020617] py-6\" data-kid=\"2-1-1\" data-name=\"Icon navigation rail\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-9\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"Primary rail navigation\">\n                <div aria-label=\"AutoDoc\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-[12px] bg-[#38BDF8] text-[#020617] shadow-[0_8px_24px_rgba(56,189,248,0.18)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"AutoDoc logo\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[18px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.08em] [font-family:'Plus_Jakarta_Sans',sans-serif]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-1-1\">\n                        AD\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <nav aria-label=\"Navegación rápida\" class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-5 text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"Rail navigation buttons\">\n                    <button aria-label=\"Inicio\" class=\"flex min-h-12 min-w-12 items-center justify-center text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"navigation button\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-layout-dashboard text-[19px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2-1-1\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Mi garaje\" class=\"flex min-h-12 min-w-12 items-center justify-center text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"navigation button\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-steering-wheel text-[19px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2-2-1\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Talleres\" class=\"flex min-h-12 min-w-12 items-center justify-center border-l-2 border-[#38BDF8] bg-[#1E293B] text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"navigation button\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-tool text-[19px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2-3-1\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Mensajes\" class=\"flex min-h-12 min-w-12 items-center justify-center text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2-4\" data-name=\"navigation button\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-message-2 text-[19px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2-4-1\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                </nav>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-5 text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"Rail secondary navigation\">\n                <button aria-label=\"Configuración\" class=\"flex min-h-12 min-w-12 items-center justify-center\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"navigation button\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-settings text-[19px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-1-1\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                </button>\n                <button aria-label=\"Ayuda\" class=\"flex min-h-12 min-w-12 items-center justify-center\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"navigation button\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-help-circle text-[19px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-2-1\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </aside>\n        <aside class=\"flex w-[220px] shrink-0 flex-col border-r border-[#334155] bg-[#0B1220]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2\" data-name=\"Contextual owner sidebar\">\n            <div class=\"border-b border-[#334155] px-6 py-7\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"Owner identity header\">\n                <div class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-1\">\n                    Propietario\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-2 flex items-center gap-2 [font-family:'Plus_Jakarta_Sans',sans-serif]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-2\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[19px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.04em]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-2-1\">\n                        Auto\n                        <span class=\"text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-2-1-1\">\n                            Doc\n                        </span>\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-2-2\">\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <nav aria-label=\"Navegación del propietario\" class=\"flex-1 px-4 py-6\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"Owner navigation\">\n                <div class=\"mb-3 px-3 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1\">\n                    Espacio de trabajo\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"space-y-1\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2\">\n                    <a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-l-2 border-transparent px-3 py-3 text-[13px] font-medium text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-1\" href=\"#\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-home-2 text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-1-1\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                        Inicio\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-l-2 border-transparent px-3 py-3 text-[13px] font-medium text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-2\" href=\"#\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-car text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-2-1\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                        Mi garaje\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-l-2 border-[#38BDF8] bg-[#1E293B] px-3 py-3 text-[13px] font-semibold text-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-3\" href=\"#\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-tool text-[17px] text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-3-1\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                        Talleres\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-l-2 border-transparent px-3 py-3 text-[13px] font-medium text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-4\" href=\"#\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-alert-triangle text-[17px] text-[#FBBF24]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-4-1\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                        Alertas\n                        <span class=\"ml-auto rounded-[4px] bg-[#7F1D1D] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-[#FCA5A5]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-4-2\">\n                            02\n                        </span>\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-l-2 border-transparent px-3 py-3 text-[13px] font-medium text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-5\" href=\"#\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-history text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-5-1\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                        Historial\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-10 border-t border-[#334155] pt-7\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-3\">\n                    <div class=\"mb-3 px-3 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-3-1\">\n                        Acceso rápido\n                    </div>\n                    <a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-3 text-[13px] font-medium text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-3-2\" href=\"#\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-calendar-plus text-[17px] text-[#818CF8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-3-2-1\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                        Agendar servicio\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-3 text-[13px] font-medium text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-3-3\" href=\"#\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-message-circle text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-3-3-1\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                        Conversaciones\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </nav>\n            <div class=\"border-t border-[#334155] px-5 py-5\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"Owner profile footer\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-1\">\n                    <div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#334155] text-[12px] font-bold text-[#E2E8F0]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-1-1\">\n                        JP\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-1-2\">\n                        <div class=\"truncate text-[12px] font-semibold text-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-1-2-1\">\n                            Juan Pérez\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-1-2-2\">\n                            Plan personal\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-dots ml-auto text-[16px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-1-3\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </aside>\n        <main class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 bg-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3\" data-name=\"Workshop directory main content\">\n            <header class=\"flex h-[76px] items-center justify-between border-b border-[#334155] px-8\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"Top header\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[12px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-1\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-1-1\">\n                        Propietario\n                    </span>\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-chevron-right text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-1-2\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                    <span class=\"font-medium text-[#E2E8F0]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-1-3\">\n                        Talleres\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2\">\n                    <div class=\"text-right\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-1\">\n                        <div class=\"text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"current date text\" data-reason=\"date updated by local system clock\">\n                            Sábado, 25 jul 2026\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-0.5 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"current time text\" data-reason=\"time updated every minute by system clock\">\n                            08:42 a. m.\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"h-5 w-px bg-[#334155]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-2\">\n                    </div>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Cambiar tema\" class=\"flex min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#334155] bg-[#141E36] text-[#94A3B8] shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] transition duration-150 ease-out hover:bg-[#1E293B] hover:text-[#81E6D9] hover:shadow-[0_6px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.35)] active:scale-[0.97]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-3\" data-name=\"change theme button\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-sun-moon text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-3-1\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Notificaciones\" class=\"relative flex min-h-[44px] min-w-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded-full border border-[#334155] bg-[#141E36] text-[#CBD5E1] shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] transition duration-150 ease-out hover:bg-[#1E293B] hover:text-[#81E6D9] hover:shadow-[0_6px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.35)] active:scale-[0.97]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-4\" data-name=\"notifications button\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-bell text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-4-1\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                        <span class=\"absolute right-2 top-2 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#F87171]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-4-2\">\n                        </span>\n                    </button>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-l border-[#334155] pl-5\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-5\">\n                        <div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#38BDF8] text-[12px] font-bold text-[#082F49]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-5-1\">\n                            JP\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#E2E8F0]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-5-2\">\n                            Juan Pérez\n                        </div>\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-chevron-down text-[14px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-5-3\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </header>\n            <div class=\"px-8 pb-12 pt-8\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"Directory content wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"mb-6 flex items-end justify-between gap-6\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"Directory title row\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-1-1\">\n                        <h1 class=\"[font-family:'Plus_Jakarta_Sans',sans-serif] text-[30px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.04em] text-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-1-1-1\">\n                            Talleres cerca de ti\n                        </h1>\n                        <p class=\"mt-2 text-[14px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-1-1-2\">\n                            Encuentra un equipo confiable para el siguiente servicio de tu vehículo.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <button class=\"flex min-h-[48px] items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#81E6D9] to-[#6FC8BC] px-5 py-3 text-[12px] font-bold text-[#0F172A] shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] transition duration-150 ease-out hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-[0_6px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.35)] active:scale-[0.97]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"use location call-to-action button\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-current-location text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-1-2-1\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                        Usar mi ubicación\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 overflow-hidden rounded-[16px] border border-[#334155]/20 bg-[#141E36] p-2 shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"directory search and filter container\">\n                    <div class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-3 border border-[#475569] bg-[#111C2E] px-4 py-3 text-[13px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-search text-[17px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1-1\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                        <span data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1-2\">\n                            Buscar talleres, servicios o ciudad\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"ml-auto rounded border border-[#475569] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1-3\">\n                            ⌘ K\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <button class=\"flex min-h-[48p