 </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <button class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-6-2\">\n                                Ver ficha\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-6-2-1\" style=\"width:13px;height:13px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                </div>\n                <footer class=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-[#334155] pt-4 text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-6\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-6-1\">\n                        AutoDoc · Diagnóstico y mantenimiento para tu vehículo\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-6-2\">\n                        <span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-6-2-1\">\n                        </span>\n                        Datos sincronizados hace 4 min\n                    </span>\n                </footer>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
