ment instructions\">\n                                    <p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-5-1-2-1\" data-name=\"attachment label\">\n                                        Adjuntar factura\n                                    </p>\n                                    <p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-5-1-2-2\" data-name=\"attachment requirements\">\n                                        PDF, JPG o PNG · visible para el propietario\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                                <button class=\"min-h-12 border border-[#CBD5E1] px-3 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#334155]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-5-1-3\" data-name=\"file select button\">\n                                    Seleccionar archivo\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"mt-2 flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] text-[#B45309]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-5-2\" data-name=\"optional attachment info\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-info-circle\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"info icon\" style=\"width:13px;height:13px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#B45309\">\n                                </i>\n                                Opcional, pero recomendado para cerrar el historial.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <button class=\"mt-5 flex min-h-12 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-[#1E88E5] px-5 text-[13px] font-bold text-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-6\" data-name=\"save service primary button\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-check\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-6-1\" data-name=\"check icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#FFFFFF\">\n                            </i>\n       