      "html": "<link data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"Google Fonts stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont/tabler-icons.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@600;700;800&display=swap');\n  .font-heading { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; }\n  .font-body { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; }\n</style>\n<style>\n    [data-name=\"new conversation button\"], [data-name=\"toggle theme button\"], [data-name=\"notifications button\"], [data-name=\"notification bell button\"], [data-name=\"more options button\"] { min-width:44px !important; min-height:44px !important; border-radius:999px !important; background:#EEEDF0 !important; border:1px solid #CBD5E1 !important; box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(15,23,42,0.05); transition:transform 150ms ease-out, background 150ms ease-out, box-shadow 150ms ease-out; }\n  [data-name=\"new conversation button\"]:hover, [data-name=\"toggle theme button\"]:hover, [data-name=\"notifications button\"]:hover, [data-name=\"notification bell button\"]:hover, [data-name=\"more options button\"]:hover { transform:scale(1.02); background:#F8FAFC !important; box-shadow:0 6px 14px rgba(15,23,42,0.12); }\n  [data-name=\"new conversation button\"]:active, [data-name=\"toggle theme button\"]:active, [data-name=\"notifications button\"]:active, [data-name=\"notification bell button\"]:active, [data-name=\"more options button\"]:active { transform:scale(0.97); }\n</style>\n<div class=\"font-body min-h-screen bg-[#F8FAFC] text-[#0F172A] antialiased\" data-kid=\"2\" data-name=\"conversation inbox application\">\n    <div class=\"flex min-h-screen\" data-kid=\"2-1\" data-name=\"conversation inbox shell\">\n        <aside class=\"flex w-[72px] shrink-0 flex-col items-center bg-[#0F172A] px-3 py-5 text-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-1\" data-name=\"primary navigation rail\">\n            <div aria-label=\"AutoDoc\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-[#1E88E5] text-[18px] font-heading font-extrabold tracking-[-0.08em]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"AutoDoc logo\">\n                AD\n            </div>\n            <nav aria-label=\"Navegación principal\" class=\"mt-8 flex flex-1 flex-col items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"primary rail navigation\">\n                <button aria-label=\"Inicio\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-xl text-[20px] text-[#94A3B8] hover:bg-[#1E293B] hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"Inicio rail button\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-dashboard\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"dashboard icon\" style=\"width:20px;height:20px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                </button>\n                <button aria-label=\"Mi garaje\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-xl text-[20px] text-[#94A3B8] hover:bg-[#1E293B] hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"Garaje rail button\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-car\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"car icon\" style=\"width:20px;height:20px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                </button>\n                <button aria-label=\"Talleres\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-xl text-[20px] text-[#94A3B8] hover:bg-[#1E293B] hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"Talleres rail button\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-tool\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"tool icon\" style=\"width:20px;height:20px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                </button>\n                <button aria-current=\"page\" aria-label=\"Conversaciones\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-[#1E88E5] text-[20px] text-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-4\" data-name=\"Active conversations rail button\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-message-2\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"message icon\" style=\"width:20px;height:20px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                </button>\n                <button aria-label=\"Alertas\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-xl text-[20px] text-[#94A3B8] hover:bg-[#1E293B] hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-5\" data-name=\"Alertas rail button\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-alert-triangle\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"alert triangle icon\" style=\"width:20px;height:20px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                </button>\n                <button aria-label=\"Historial\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-xl text-[20px] text-[#94A3B8] hover:bg-[#1E293B] hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-6\" data-name=\"Historial rail button\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-history\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-6-1\" data-name=\"history icon\" style=\"width:20px;height:20px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                </button>\n            </nav>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-3 border-t border-[#334155] pt-4\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"rail utility buttons\">\n                <button aria-label=\"Ayuda\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center rounded-xl text-[19px] text-[#94A3B8] hover:bg-[#1E293B] hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-3-1\" data-name=\"Help rail button\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-help-circle\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"help circle icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                </button>\n                <button aria-label=\"Configuración\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center rounded-xl text-[19px] text-[#94A3B8] hover:bg-[#1E293B] hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-3-2\" data-name=\"Settings rail button\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-settings\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"settings icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </aside>\n        <aside class=\"flex w-[300px] shrink-0 flex-col border-r border-[#CBD5E1] bg-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-2\" data-name=\"conversation thread sidebar\">\n            <div class=\"border-b border-[#E2E8F0] px-6 pb-5 pt-6\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"conversation sidebar header\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"conversation title row\">\n                    <div data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-1-3\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"sidebar role label\">\n                            Propietario\n                        </p>\n                        <h1 class=\"mt-1 font-heading text-[22px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.04em] text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"conversation page title\">\n                            Conversaciones\n                        </h1>\n                    </div>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Nueva conversación\" class=\"grid size-10 place-items-center border border-[#CBD5E1] text-[18px] text-[#1E88E5] hover:border-[#1E88E5] hover:bg-[#F8FAFC]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"new conversation button\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-edit\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"edit icon\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n                <label class=\"mt-5 flex h-11 items-center gap-3 border border-[#CBD5E1] bg-[#F8FAFC] px-3 text-[16px] text-[#64748B] focus-within:border-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"conversation search field\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-search\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"search icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                    <span class=\"sr-only\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-3-2\">\n                        Buscar conversación\n                    </span>\n                    <input aria-label=\"Buscar conversación\" class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 bg-transparent text-[13px] text-[#0F172A] outline-hidden placeholder:text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-3-3\" placeholder=\"Buscar conversación\" type=\"search\"/>\n                    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-3-4\">\n                        ⌘K\n                    </span>\n                </label>\n                <div class=\"mt-5 flex items-center gap-6 text-[12px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-4\" data-name=\"conversation filter tabs\">\n                    <button aria-current=\"page\" class=\"border-b-2 border-[#1E88E5] pb-3 text-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"all conversations tab\">\n                        Todas\n                        <span class=\"ml-1 tabular-nums\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"all conversations count\">\n                            3\n                        </span>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"pb-3 text-[#64748B] hover:text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"unread conversations tab\">\n                        No leídas\n                        <span class=\"ml-1 tabular-nums\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"unread conversations count\">\n                            1\n                        </span>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex-1\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"conversation thread list\">\n                <button aria-current=\"true\" class=\"flex w-full items-start gap-3 border-l-3 border-[#1E88E5] bg-[#E8F2FD] px-5 py-5 text-left\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"selected Taller Rápido thread\">\n                    <span class=\"grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#DBEAFE] text-[12px] font-bold text-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"Taller Rápido avatar\">\n                        TR\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2\">\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-1\">\n                            <strong class=\"truncate text-[13px] font-bold text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-1-1\">\n                                Taller Rápido\n                            </strong>\n                            <time class=\"shrink-0 text-[11px] font-bold text-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"message time\">\n                                09:42\n                            </time>\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"mt-1 block truncate text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#334155]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-2\">\n                            La revisión estará lista mañana\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"mt-2 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#10B981]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-3\">\n                            <span class=\"size-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#10B981]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"online status dot\">\n                            </span>\n                            En línea · Toyota Corolla\n                        </span>\n                    </span>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"flex w-full items-start gap-3 border-b border-[#E2E8F0] px-5 py-5 text-left hover:bg-[#F8FAFC]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"MotorLab thread\">\n                    <span class=\"grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#F1F5F9] text-[12px] font-bold text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"MotorLab avatar\">\n                        ML\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-2\">\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-2-1\">\n                            <strong class=\"truncate text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-2-1-1\">\n                                MotorLab\n                            </strong>\n                            <time class=\"shrink-0 text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-2-1-2\">\n                                Ayer\n                            </time>\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"mt-1 block truncate text-[12px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-2-2\">\n                            Te enviamos la cotización\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"mt-2 block text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#F59E0B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-2-3\">\n                            Cotización pendiente\n                        </span>\n                    </span>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"flex w-full items-start gap-3 border-b border-[#E2E8F0] px-5 py-5 text-left hover:bg-[#F8FAFC]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"Centro Auto thread\">\n                    <span class=\"grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#F1F5F9] text-[12px] font-bold text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"Centro Auto avatar\">\n                        CA\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-3-2\">\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-3-2-1\">\n                            <strong class=\"truncate text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-3-2-1-1\">\n                                Centro Auto\n                            </strong>\n                            <time class=\"shrink-0 text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-3-2-1-2\">\n                                Lun\n                            </time>\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"mt-1 block truncate text-[12px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-3-2-2\">\n                            ¿Podemos ayudarte?\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"mt-2 block text-[11px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-3-2-3\">\n                            Sin mensajes nuevos\n                        </span>\n                    </span>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"border-t border-[#E2E8F0] px-6 py-4 text-[11px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"conversation sidebar footer\">\n                3 conversaciones activas\n            </div>\n        </aside>\n        <main class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 bg-[#F8FAFC]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3\" data-name=\"conversation preview main\">\n            <header class=\"flex h-[76px] items-center justify-between border-b border-[#CBD5E1] bg-white px-8\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"conversation preview header\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"conversation breadcrumb\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-1-1\">\n                        Propietario\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-1-2\">\n                        /\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"font-semibold text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-1-3\">\n                        Conversaciones\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"preview header utilities\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[12px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-4\">\n                        3 conversaciones activas\n                    </span>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Notificaciones\" class=\"grid size-9 place-items-center rounded-lg text-[19px] text-[#64748B] hover:bg-[#F1F5F9] hover:text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"notifications button\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-bell\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"bell icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Cambiar a modo oscuro\" class=\"grid size-9 place-items-center rounded-lg text-[19px] text-[#64748B] hover:bg-[#F1F5F9] hover:text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"theme toggle button\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-moon\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"moon icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                    <div class=\"h-6 w-px bg-[#E2E8F0]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-7\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"grid size-9 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#DBEAFE] text-[12px] font-bold text-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-3\" data-name=\"user initials\">\n                        JP\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </header>\n            <div class=\"mx-auto flex min-h-[724px] max-w-[920px] flex-col px-10 py-12\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"conversation preview content\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-[720px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"preview title block\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-1-3\">\n                        Bandeja de entrada\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-3 font-heading text-[32px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.045em] text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"selection prompt\">\n                        Selecciona una conversación\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] leading-6 text-[#475569]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"selection description\">\n                        Revisa la conversación con tu taller para seguir el estado de una reparación, confirmar una cotización o resolver una duda.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <section class=\"mt-10 max-w-[720px] rounded-[16px] border border-l-4 border-[#1E88E5] bg-[#EEEDF0] px-7 py-6 shadow-[0_1px_2px_rgba(15,23,42,0.04)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"selected conversation preview container\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-5\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"selected preview header\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1-1\">\n                            <span class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#DBEAFE] text-[13px] font-bold text-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"selected thread avatar\">\n                                TR\n                            </span>\n                            <div data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1-1-2\">\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1-1-2-1\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"font-heading text-[18px] font-bold text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1-1-2-1-1\">\n                                        Taller Rápido\n                                    </h3>\n                                    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#10B981]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1-1-2-1-2\">\n                                        <span class=\"size-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#10B981]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1-1-2-1-2-1\">\n                                        </span>\n                                        En línea\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1-1-2-2\">\n                                    Toyota Corolla 2022 · P 482-916\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <time class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"selected thread time\">\n                            09:42\n                        </time>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mt-6 border-y border-[#E2E8F0] py-5\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"selected preview message\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-1\">\n                            Último mensaje\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-2 text-[15px] leading-6 text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-2\">\n                            La revisión estará lista mañana\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-3\">\n                            El taller actualizó la conversación hace unos minutos.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-between gap-4\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-3\" data-name=\"preview action row\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[12px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-3-2\">\n                            Hay 1 mensaje sin leer.\n                        </p>\n                        <button class=\"inline-flex min-h-[48px] items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#522C81] to-[#45256D] px-5 py-3 text-[13px] font-bold text-white shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(15,23,42,0.05)] transition duration-150 ease-out hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-[0_6px_14px_rgba(15,23,42,0.12)] active:scale-[0.97]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"open conversation button\">\n                            Abrir conversación\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"arrow up right icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                            </i>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n                <div class=\"mt-auto flex max-w-[720px] items-center gap-2 border-t border-[#CBD5E1] pt-6 text-[12px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-3\" data-name=\"inbox guidance\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-info-circle text-[17px] text-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"info icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                    <span data-kid=\"2-1-3-3-2\">\n                        Al abrir una conversación podrás ver mensajes, cotizaciones y reservas asociadas a tu vehículo.\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
