\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-2-2-1-2\">\n                                        P 482-916\n                                        <span class=\"text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-2-2-1-2-1\">\n                                            ·\n                                        </span>\n                                        48,260 km\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"text-[12px] font-medium text-[#E2E8F0]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-2-2-2\">\n                                    Juan Pérez\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"text-[12px] text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-2-2-3\">\n                                    12 jun 2026\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#FCD34D]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-2-2-4\">\n                                    <span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#FBBF24]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-2-2-4-1\">\n                                    </span>\n                                    Revisión pronta\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[1.4fr_1fr_1fr_0.9fr] items-center border-b border-[#334155] px-4 py-4\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-2-3\">\n                                <div data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-2-3-1\">\n                                    <div class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#E2E8F0]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-2-3-1-1\">\n                                        Mazda 3 2019\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] tabular-nums text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-1-2-3-1-2\">\n                                        H 731-204\n                                        <span class=\"text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-