                               Centro Auto\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"tabular-nums text-[#475569]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-1-2-4-4\">\n                                    43,100 km\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"tabular-nums font-semibold text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-1-2-4-5\">\n                                    $95.00\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 font-semibold text-[#10B981]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-1-2-4-6\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-circle-check-filled text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-1-2-4-6-1\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    Completado\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-[112px_minmax(0,1.5fr)_minmax(0,1.1fr)_110px_90px_120px] items-center gap-3 border-dashed border-t border-[#CBD5E1] px-4 py-4 text-[12px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-1-2-5\" data-name=\"empty history row\">\n                                <span class=\"col-span-2 flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-1-2-5-1\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-history-toggle text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-1-2-5-1-1\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    No hay más servicios en este periodo\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"col-span-4 text-right\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-1-2-5-2\">\n                                    Ajusta el rango para consultar más actividad\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                    <aside aria-labelledby=\"annual-summary-title\" class=\"rounded-[16px] border border-[#CBD5E1]/40 bg-[#EEEDF0] p-6 shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(15,23,42,0.05)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2\" data-name=\"annual summary card\">\n                        <div class=\"border-b border-[#CBD5E1] pb-5\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-1\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-1-1\">\n                                <h2 class=\"font-heading text-[18px] font-bold tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-1-1-1\" id=\"annual-summary-title\">\n                                    Resumen anual\n                                </h2>\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-chart-line text-[18px] text-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-1-1-2\">\n                                </i>\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-1-2\">\n                                Mantenimiento registrado · 2026\n                            </p>\n                            <div class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-[29px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.05em] text-[#1E88E5] tabular-nums\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-1-3\">\n                                $684.50\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-1-4\">\n                                Total invertido en 3 servicios\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"space-y-4 py-5\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-2\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#E2E8F0] pb-3\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-2-1\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[12px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-2-1-1\">\n                                    Servicios registrados\n                                </span>\n                                <strong class=\"font-heading text-[18px] text-[#0F172A] tabular-nums\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-2-1-2\">\n                                    3\n                                </strong>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#E2E8F0] pb-3\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-2-2\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[12px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-2-2-1\">\n                                    Promedio por visita\n                                </span>\n                                <strong class=\"font-heading text-[18px] text-[#0F172A] tabular-nums\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-2-2-2\">\n                                    $228.17\n                                </strong>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-2-3\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[12px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-2-3-1\">\n                                    Última visita\n                                </span>\n                                <strong class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-2-3-2\">\n                                    12 jun 2026\n                                </strong>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <button class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px] font-bold text-[#1E88E5] hover:text-[#176FBB]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-3\">\n                            Ver resumen completo\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-3-1\">\n                            </i>\n                        </button>\n                    </aside>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-[#CBD5E1] pt-5\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-5\" data-name=\"history footer\">\n                    <p class=\"text-[11px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-5-1\">\n                        AutoDoc · Historial y mantenimiento vehicular · Datos sincronizados con tu garaje\n                    </p>\n                    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-5-2\" data-name=\"last sync time text\" data-reason=\"text updated based on time since last sync\">\n                        <span class=\"size-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#10B981]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"sync indicator status\" data-reason=\"indicator color updated by sync script\">\n                        </span>\n                        Última sincronización hace 8 min\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
