                       <p class=\"text-[12px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"pagination information text\">\n                            ¿No encuentras una cuenta? Limpia los filtros o crea un nuevo usuario.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"pagination controls\">\n                            <span class=\"mr-2 text-[12px] text-[#64748B]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-3-1-5\" data-name=\"range display text\" data-reason=\"range text updated by script based on current page\">\n                                1–3 de 1,284\n                            </span>\n                            <button aria-label=\"Página anterior\" class=\"grid size-9 place-items-center border border-[#CBD5E1] text-[17px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-3-1-1\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-chevron-left\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"chevron left icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n                            </button>\n                            <button aria-label=\"Página 1\" class=\"grid size-9 place-items-center bg-[#1E88E5] text-[12px] font-bold text-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-3-1-2\">\n                                1\n                            </button>\n                            <button aria-label=\"Página 2\" class=\"grid size-9 place-items-center border border-[#CBD5E1] text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#334155]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-3-1-3\">\n                                2\n                            </button>\n                            <button aria-label=\"Página siguiente\" class=\"grid size-9 place-items-center border border-[#CBD5E1] text-[17px] text-[#334155]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-3-1-4\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-chevron-right\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-3-1-4-1\" data-name=\"chevron right icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n                <p class=\"mt-7 pb-2 text-[11px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4\" data-name=\"admin users footer\" data-reason=\"last updated time dynamically refreshed by script\">\n                    AutoDoc · Consola de administración · Datos sincronizados hace 4 min\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
