               <p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#991B1B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-1-2-1-2-1\">\n                                                SOAT vencido\n                                            </p>\n                                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-1-2-1-2-2\">\n                                                Renovar antes de circular\n                                            </p>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 py-4\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-1-2-2\">\n                                        <i class=\"ti ti-tool mt-0.5 text-[18px] text-[#F59E0B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-1-2-2-1\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                        </i>\n                                        <div data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-1-2-2-2\">\n                                            <p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#A16207]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-1-2-2-2-1\">\n                                                Frenos próximos\n                                            </p>\n                                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-1-2-2-2-2\">\n                                                Revisar en 420 km\n                                            </p>\n                                        </div>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-7 flex flex-col gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-4\">\n                                <button class=\"inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-[#1E88E5] px-4 text-[13px] font-bold text-white hover:bg-[#176FBB]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"start service button\">\n                                    Iniciar servicio\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-3-1\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </button>\n                                <button class=\"inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-[#CBD5E1] px-4 text-[13px] font-bold text-[#1E88E5] hover:border-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-4\" data-name=\"view history button\">\n                                    Ver historial\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-history text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-4-1\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </aside>\n                </div>\n                <footer class=\"mt-8 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-[#CBD5E1] pt-5 text-[11px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4\" data-name=\"page footer\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-1\">\n                        AutoDoc · Gestión operativa del taller\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2\">\n                        <span class=\"size-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#10B981]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-2-1\">\n                        </span>\n                        Datos sincronizados hace 4 min\n                    </span>\n                </footer>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
