"width:15px;height:15px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-star-filled\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-3-2-1-2\" style=\"width:15px;height:15px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-star-filled\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-3-2-1-3\" style=\"width:15px;height:15px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-star text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-3-2-1-4\" style=\"width:15px;height:15px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-star text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-3-2-1-5\" style=\"width:15px;height:15px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n                                <span class=\"ml-2 tabular-nums text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#FCD34D]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-3-2-1-6\">\n                                    3.0\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] font-medium text-[#E2E8F0]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-3-2-2\">\n                                La información del servicio podría ser más clara.\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-2 text-[12px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-3-2-3\">\n                                Una respuesta del taller puede ayudar a cerrar esta experiencia.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-end\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-3-3\">\n                            <button class=\"flex h-10 items-center gap-2 border border-[#475569] px-3 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-3-3-1\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-message-2 text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-3-3-1-1\" style=\"width:15px;height:15px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n                                Responder\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                </section>\n                <footer class=\"mt-8 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-[#334155] pt-5 text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-5\" data-name=\"reviews footer\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-5-1\">\n                        AutoDoc · Gestión operativa del taller\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-5-2\" data-name=\"sync status timestamp\" data-reason=\"text updated by sync monitor script\">\n                        <span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-5-2-1\">\n                        </span>\n                        Datos sincronizados hace 4 min\n                    </span>\n                </footer>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
