      "html": "<link data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"Tabler Icons stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont/tabler-icons.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@600;700;800&display=swap');\n</style>\n<div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#0F172A] text-[#F8FAFC] antialiased\" data-kid=\"2\" data-name=\"main page container\" style=\"font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',sans-serif\">\n    <div class=\"flex min-h-screen\" data-kid=\"2-1\" data-name=\"layout wrapper\">\n        <aside aria-label=\"Navegación principal\" class=\"flex w-[72px] shrink-0 flex-col items-center justify-between border-r border-[#334155] bg-[#020617] py-6\" data-kid=\"2-1-1\" data-name=\"sidebar navigation\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-9\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand and navigation container\">\n                <div aria-label=\"AutoDoc\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-[12px] bg-[#38BDF8] text-[#020617] shadow-[0_8px_24px_rgba(56,189,248,0.16)]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand logo container\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[18px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.08em]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"brand initial text\" style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif\">\n                        AD\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-5 text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"primary navigation links\">\n                    <button aria-label=\"Inicio\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center text-[#94A3B8] hover:bg-[#1E293B] hover:text-[#F8FAFC]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"home link button\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-home-2 text-[19px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"home icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Mi garaje\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center text-[#94A3B8] hover:bg-[#1E293B] hover:text-[#F8FAFC]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"garage link button\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-steering-wheel text-[19px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"garage icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Talleres\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center text-[#94A3B8] hover:bg-[#1E293B] hover:text-[#F8FAFC]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"workshops link button\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-tool text-[19px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"workshops icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Alertas\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center text-[#94A3B8] hover:bg-[#1E293B] hover:text-[#F8FAFC]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2-4\" data-name=\"alerts link button\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-alert-triangle text-[19px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"alerts icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Historial\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center text-[#94A3B8] hover:bg-[#1E293B] hover:text-[#F8FAFC]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2-5\" data-name=\"history link button\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-history text-[19px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"history icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-5 text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"secondary navigation links\">\n                <button aria-label=\"Configuración\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center hover:bg-[#1E293B] hover:text-[#F8FAFC]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"settings link button\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-settings text-[19px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"settings icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                </button>\n                <button aria-label=\"Ayuda\" class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center hover:bg-[#1E293B] hover:text-[#F8FAFC]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"help link button\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-help-circle text-[19px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"help icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </aside>\n        <aside aria-label=\"Navegación del propietario\" class=\"flex w-[220px] shrink-0 flex-col border-r border-[#334155] bg-[#0B1220]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2\" data-name=\"owner secondary navigation\">\n            <div class=\"border-b border-[#334155] px-6 py-7\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"owner brand header\">\n                <div class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"role label text\">\n                    Propietario\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-2 flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"brand name container\" style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[19px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.04em]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"brand name\">\n                        Auto\n                        <span class=\"text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"brand name colored suffix\">\n                            Doc\n                        </span>\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"status indicator dot\">\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <nav class=\"flex-1 px-4 py-6\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"owner main navigation menu\">\n                <div class=\"mb-3 px-3 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"workspace header\">\n                    Espacio de trabajo\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"space-y-1\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"menu links list\">\n                    <a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-l-2 border-transparent px-3 py-3 text-[13px] font-medium text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"workspace home link\" href=\"#\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-home-2 text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"workspace home icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                        Inicio\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-l-2 border-transparent px-3 py-3 text-[13px] font-medium text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"workspace garage link\" href=\"#\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-car text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"workspace garage icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                        Mi garaje\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-l-2 border-transparent px-3 py-3 text-[13px] font-medium text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"workspace workshops link\" href=\"#\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-tool text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"workspace workshops icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                        Talleres\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-l-2 border-transparent px-3 py-3 text-[13px] font-medium text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-4\" data-name=\"workspace alerts link\" href=\"#\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-alert-triangle text-[17px] text-[#FBBF24]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"workspace alerts icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                        Alertas\n                        <span class=\"ml-auto rounded-[4px] bg-[#7F1D1D] px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-[#FCA5A5]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"alerts counter badge\" data-reason=\"count value updated by script\">\n                            02\n                        </span>\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-l-2 border-transparent px-3 py-3 text-[13px] font-medium text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-5\" data-name=\"workspace history link\" href=\"#\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-history text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"workspace history icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                        Historial\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-10 border-t border-[#334155] pt-7\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"quick access section\">\n                    <div class=\"mb-3 px-3 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"quick access header\">\n                        Acceso rápido\n                    </div>\n                    <a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-3 text-[13px] font-medium text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"schedule service link\" href=\"#\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-calendar-plus text-[17px] text-[#818CF8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"schedule icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                        Agendar servicio\n                    </a>\n                    <a class=\"flex items-center gap-3 px-3 py-3 text-[13px] font-medium text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"conversations link\" href=\"#\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-message-circle text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"conversations icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                        Conversaciones\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </nav>\n            <div class=\"border-t border-[#334155] px-5 py-5\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"user account summary\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"user account info\">\n                    <div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#334155] text-[12px] font-bold text-[#E2E8F0]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"user avatar initials\">\n                        JP\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"user profile name and plan\">\n                        <div class=\"truncate text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#F8FAFC]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"user name\">\n                            Juan Pérez\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"user plan\">\n                            Plan personal\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-dots ml-auto text-[16px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-3-1-3\" data-name=\"user menu options icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </aside>\n        <main class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 bg-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3\" data-name=\"main page content area\">\n            <header class=\"flex h-[76px] items-center justify-between border-b border-[#334155] px-8\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"main page top header\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 text-[12px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"breadcrumb navigation\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"breadcrumb parent\">\n                        Propietario\n                    </span>\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-chevron-right text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"chevron separator icon\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                    <span class=\"font-medium text-[#E2E8F0]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-1-3\" data-name=\"breadcrumb active page\">\n                        Recordatorios\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"header controls container\">\n                    <div class=\"text-right\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"date and time display\">\n                        <div class=\"text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"current date text\" data-reason=\"date updated by local system clock script\">\n                            Sábado, 25 jul 2026\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-0.5 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"current time text\" data-reason=\"time updated every minute by clock script\">\n                            08:42 a. m.\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"h-5 w-px bg-[#334155]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"separator line\">\n                    </div>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Cambiar tema\" class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center border border-[#475569] text-[#94A3B8] hover:border-[#38BDF8] hover:text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-3\" data-name=\"theme toggle button\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-sun-moon text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"theme toggle icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                    <button aria-label=\"Notificaciones\" class=\"relative flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center border border-[#475569] text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-4\" data-name=\"notifications button\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-bell text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-4-1\" data-name=\"bell icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                        <span class=\"absolute right-1 top-1 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#F87171]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-4-2\" data-name=\"notification indicator dot\">\n                        </span>\n                    </button>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 border-l border-[#334155] pl-5\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-5\" data-name=\"profile section\">\n                        <div class=\"flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#38BDF8] text-[12px] font-bold text-[#082F49]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"profile avatar initials\">\n                            JP\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#E2E8F0]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-5-2\" data-name=\"profile username\">\n                            Juan Pérez\n                        </div>\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-chevron-down text-[14px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-1-2-5-3\" data-name=\"profile dropdown arrow\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </header>\n            <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[960px] px-8 pb-12 pt-8\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"form content wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"mb-7\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"form page title header\">\n                    <h1 class=\"text-[30px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.04em] text-[#F8FAFC]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"page headline\" style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif\">\n                        Configurar recordatorio\n                    </h1>\n                    <p class=\"mt-2 max-w-[640px] text-[14px] leading-6 text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"page description text\">\n                        Define cuándo quieres volver a recibir una alerta para que el mantenimiento llegue antes que la urgencia.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <section class=\"mx-auto max-w-[560px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"configuration form\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-y border-[#334155] py-5\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"service status summary\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"service task info\">\n                            <div class=\"flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center border border-[#475569] bg-[#1E293B] text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"service icon container\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-engine text-[23px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"service icon\" style=\"width:23px;height:23px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n                            </div>\n                            <div data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"service details text\">\n                                <div class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"task category label\">\n                                    Tarea de mantenimiento\n                                </div>\n                                <h2 class=\"mt-1 text-[18px] font-bold text-[#F8FAFC]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"task name\" style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif\">\n                                    Cambio de aceite\n                                </h2>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"vehicle details text\">\n                                    Toyota Corolla 2022 · P 482-916\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-[#34D399]/40 px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold tracking-[0.12em] text-[#6EE7B7]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"status badge\">\n                            <span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"status dot\">\n                            </span>\n                            ACTIVO\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"border-b border-[#334155] py-7\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"maintenance frequency settings\">\n                        <h3 class=\"text-[16px] font-bold text-[#F8FAFC]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"frequency title\" style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif\">\n                            Frecuencia de mantenimiento\n                        </h3>\n                        <p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"frequency description\">\n                            Usaremos el kilometraje y la fecha del último servicio para calcular el siguiente recordatorio.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-6 space-y-5\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"form input fields container\">\n                            <label class=\"block\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"mileage field container\">\n                                <span class=\"mb-2 block text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"mileage label\">\n                                    Kilometraje actual\n                                </span>\n                                <div class=\"flex h-12 items-center border border-[#38BDF8] bg-[#111C2D] px-4 ring-2 ring-[#38BDF8]/20\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"mileage input wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-gauge text-[18px] text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"gauge icon\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    <input aria-label=\"Kilometraje actual\" class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 bg-transparent px-3 text-[14px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[#F8FAFC] outline-none\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"mileage input\" data-reason=\"value dynamically fetched from vehicle telemetry\" value=\"48,260\"/>\n                                    <span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-3-1-2-3\" data-name=\"unit suffix label\">\n                                        km\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"mt-2 flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-3-1-3\" data-name=\"sync status hint\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-info-circle text-[14px] text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-3-1-3-1\" data-name=\"info icon\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    Campo enfocado · dato sincronizado desde tu vehículo.\n                                </span>\n                            </label>\n                            <label class=\"block\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"frequency interval field\">\n                                <span class=\"mb-2 block text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"frequency label\">\n                                    Recordar cada\n                                </span>\n                                <div class=\"flex h-12 items-center border border-[#475569] bg-[#1E293B] px-4 hover:border-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"frequency input wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-road-sign text-[18px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"road sign icon\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    <input aria-label=\"Recordar cada\" class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 bg-transparent px-3 text-[14px] font-semibold tabular-nums text-[#F8FAFC] outline-none\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"frequency interval input\" value=\"10,000\"/>\n                                    <span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-3-2-2-3\" data-name=\"unit suffix label\">\n                                        km\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                                <span class=\"mt-2 text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"frequency hint\">\n                                    Puedes cambiarlo para ajustarlo a tu forma de conducir.\n                                </span>\n                            </label>\n                            <label class=\"block\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"next service field\">\n                                <span class=\"mb-2 block text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"next service label\">\n                                    Próxima revisión\n                                </span>\n                                <div class=\"flex h-12 items-center border border-[#334155] bg-[#111827] px-4\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"date display wrapper\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-calendar-event text-[18px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-3-3-2-1\" data-name=\"calendar icon\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    <span class=\"px-3 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#E2E8F0]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-3-3-2-2\" data-name=\"next service date text\" data-reason=\"date calculated and injected by script\">\n                                        12 jun 2027\n                                    </span>\n                                    <span class=\"ml-auto text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-2-3-3-2-3\" data-name=\"calc status label\">\n                                        Calculada\n                                    </span>\n                                </div>\n                            </label>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"border-b border-[#334155] py-6\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-3\" data-name=\"advanced notification settings\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-6\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"notification switch container\">\n                            <div data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"switch label header\">\n                                <h3 class=\"text-[15px] font-bold text-[#F8FAFC]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"advanced notification title\" style=\"font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif\">\n                                    Avisarme con anticipación\n                                </h3>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] leading-5 text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"advanced notification description\">\n                                    Recibe una alerta antes de que llegue la fecha o el kilometraje.\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <button aria-label=\"Avisarme con anticipación activado\" class=\"relative h-7 w-12 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-[#38BDF8]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"notification toggle button\" data-reason=\"toggle state switched by user script\">\n                                <span class=\"absolute right-1 top-1 h-5 w-5 rounded-full bg-[#082F49]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"toggle handle\" data-reason=\"toggle position animated by user script\">\n                                </span>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-5 flex items-start gap-3 border-l-2 border-[#38BDF8] bg-[#132B40] px-4 py-3\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"notification summary box\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-bell-ringing mt-0.5 text-[17px] text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"ringing bell icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                            </i>\n                            <div data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"summary text container\">\n                                <div class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#E0F2FE]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"notification alert title\">\n                                    Te avisaremos 500 km antes\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-0.5 text-[11px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"notification alert details\">\n                                    También recibirás un recordatorio cuando se acerque la fecha programada.\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4 pt-6\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-4\" data-name=\"form action buttons\">\n                        <button class=\"h-12 px-5 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#94A3B8] hover:bg-[#1E293B] hover:text-[#F8FAFC]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"cancel button\">\n                            Cancelar\n                        </button>\n                        <button class=\"flex min-h-12 items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#81E6D9] to-[#6FC8BC] px-5 py-3 text-[13px] font-bold text-[#0F172A] shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] transition duration-150 ease-out hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-[0_6px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.35)] active:scale-[0.97]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"save button\">\n                            Guardar recordatorio\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-check text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"check mark icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                            </i>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"mt-5 flex items-start gap-2 text-[11px] leading-5 text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-5\" data-name=\"validation warning text\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-shield-check mt-0.5 text-[14px] text-[#34D399]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"shield check icon\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                        Los cambios se guardan en tu historial de mantenimiento. Si un valor no es válido, verás el mensaje junto al campo antes de guardar.\n                    </p>\n                </section>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
