             Dirección visible\n                                    </span>\n                                    <div class=\"flex min-h-12 items-center border border-[#CBD5E1] bg-[#F8FAFC] px-3\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"input wrapper\">\n                                        <i class=\"ti ti-map-pin text-[18px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"map pin icon\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                        </i>\n                                        <span class=\"ml-3 text-[13px] text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"field value\">\n                                            San Salvador, San Salvador\n                                        </span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border border-[#D1FAE5] bg-[#F0FDF4] px-3 py-3\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"location registered notice\">\n                                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"notice content\">\n                                        <i class=\"ti ti-map-check text-[19px] text-[#15803D]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"map check icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                        </i>\n                                        <div data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"notice text container\">\n                                            <p class=\"text-[12px] font-bold text-[#166534]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-3-2-2-3-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"notice title\">\n                                                Ubicación registrada\n                                            </p>\n                                           