    Mensaje de Taller Rápido\n                                    </strong>\n                                    <time class=\"shrink-0 text-[12px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-1-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"notification timestamp\">\n                                        Hace 2 días\n                                    </time>\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"mt-1 block text-[13px] text-[#475569]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"notification details\">\n                                    La revisión estará lista mañana. Puedes ver la reserva desde la conversación.\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"mt-2 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#1D4ED8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-1-2-2-3\" data-name=\"status tag\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-4-1-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"arrow up right icon\" style=\"width:13px;height:13px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    Ver conversación\n                                </span>\n                            </span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n                <div class=\"mt-8 flex items-center gap-3 border border-dashed border-[#CBD5E1] bg-white px-5 py-4\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-5\" data-name=\"contextual empty state\">\n                    <span class=\"grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center bg-[#F1F5F9] text-[19px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-5-1\" data-name=\"empty state icon container\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-inbox\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"inbox icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </span>\n                    <p class=\"text-[13px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-5-2\" data-name=\"empty state text\">\n                        Cuando no haya más avisos, aparecerán aquí para que puedas revisar tu historial de actividad.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <footer class=\"mt-7 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-[#CBD5E1] pt-5 text-[11px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-6\" data-name=\"notifications footer\">\n                    <span data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-6-1\" data-name=\"footer brand text\">\n                        AutoDoc · Centro de notificaciones\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-6-2\" data-name=\"sync status\">\n                        <span class=\"size-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#10B981]\" data-kid=\"2-1-3-2-6-2-1\" data-name=\"status online dot\">\n                        </span>\n                        Última sincronización hace 8 min\n                    </span>\n                </footer>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
