alue\">\n                                Hace 44 min\n                            </dd>\n                        </div>\n                    </dl>\n                </article>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-4 border-y border-[#CBD5E1] py-4\" data-kid=\"2-2-3-4\" data-name=\"mobile pagination and empty state footer\">\n                <p class=\"text-[12px] leading-5 text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"mobile pagination information\">\n                    ¿No encuentras una cuenta? Limpia los filtros o crea un nuevo usuario.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"mt-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-2-3-4-2\" data-name=\"mobile pagination controls\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[12px] text-[#64748B]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-3-4-2-1\" data-name=\"mobile range display\" data-reason=\"range text updated by script based on current page\">\n                        1–3 de 1,284\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\" data-kid=\"2-2-3-4-2-2\" data-name=\"page buttons wrapper\">\n                        <button aria-label=\"Página anterior\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center border border-[#CBD5E1] text-[17px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-3-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"previous page button\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-chevron-left\" data-kid=\"2-2-3-4-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"chevron left icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                            </i>\n                        </button>\n                        <button aria-label=\"Página 1\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center bg-[#1E88E5] text-[12px] font-bold text-white\" data-kid=\"2-2-3-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"page one button\">\n                            1\n                        </button>\n                        <button aria-label=\"Página 2\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center border border-[#CBD5E1] text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#334155]\" data-kid=\"2-2-3-4-2-2-3\" data-name=\"page two button\">\n                            2\n                        </button>\n                        <button aria-label=\"Página siguiente\" class=\"grid size-11 place-items-center border border-[#CBD5E1] text-[17px] text-[#334155]\" data-kid=\"2-2-3-4-2-2-4\" data-name=\"next page button\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-chevron-right\" data-kid=\"2-2-3-4-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"chevron right icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                            </i>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <p class=\"mt-7 pb-2 text-[11px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"2-2-4\" data-name=\"admin users mobile footer\" data-reason=\"last updated time dynamically refreshed by script\">\n            AutoDoc · Consola de administración · Datos sincronizados hace 4 min\n        </p>\n    </main>\n    <nav aria-label=\"Navegación de administración\" class=\"fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-30 border-t border-[#CBD5E1] bg-white/95 px-2 pb-[max(10px,env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] pt-2 backdrop-blur-sm\" data-kid=\"2-3\" data-name=\"admin mobile bottom navigation\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[375px] grid-cols-5 gap-1\" data-kid=\"2-3-6\" data-name=\"navigation items grid\">\n            <a class=\"flex min-h-[52px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-lg text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-3-1\" data-name=\"overview mobile navigation item\" href=\"#resumen\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-layout-dashboard text-[19px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"overview icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                </i>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"overview label\">\n                    Resumen\n                </span>\n            </a>\n            <a aria-current=\"page\" class=\"flex min-h-[52px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-lg bg-[#E8F2FD] text-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-3-2\" data-name=\"active users mobile navigation item\" href=\"#usuarios\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-users text-[19px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"users icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                </i>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"users label\">\n                    Usuarios\n                </span>\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"flex min-h-[52px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-lg text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-3-3\" data-name=\"workshops mobile navigation item\" href=\"#talleres\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-tool text-[19px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"workshops icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                </i>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"2-3-3-2\" data-name=\"workshops label\">\n                    Talleres\n                </span>\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"flex min-h-[52px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-lg text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-3-4\" data-name=\"logs mobile navigation item\" href=\"#logs\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-list-details text-[19px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-1\" data-name=\"logs icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                </i>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"2-3-4-2\" data-name=\"logs label\">\n                    Logs\n                </span>\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"flex min-h-[52px] flex-col items-center justify-center gap-1 rounded-lg text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-3-5\" data-name=\"settings mobile navigation item\" href=\"#configuracion\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-settings text-[19px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-1\" data-name=\"settings icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                </i>\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium\" data-kid=\"2-3-5-2\" data-name=\"settings label\">\n                    Configuración\n                </span>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n</div>\n",
