      "html": "<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@600;700;800&display=swap');\n  .font-heading { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; }\n  .font-body { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; }\n</style>\n<link data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"Tabler icon font stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont/tabler-icons.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<div class=\"font-body min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden bg-[#F8FAFC] text-[#0F172A] antialiased\" data-kid=\"2\" data-name=\"pending approval mobile page\">\n    <header class=\"flex min-h-[68px] items-center justify-between border-b border-[#E2E8F0] bg-white px-4 py-3\" data-kid=\"2-1\" data-name=\"mobile pending page header\">\n        <div class=\"flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2.5\" data-kid=\"2-1-1\" data-name=\"mobile AutoDoc brand lockup\">\n            <div aria-label=\"AutoDoc\" class=\"grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-[11px] bg-[#1E88E5] text-[17px] font-heading font-extrabold tracking-[-0.08em] text-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"mobile AutoDoc logo mark\">\n                AD\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"mobile brand wordmark group\">\n                <div class=\"truncate font-heading text-[15px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.04em] text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"mobile brand name AutoDoc\">\n                    AutoDoc\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"truncate text-[10px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"mobile brand tagline text\">\n                    Gestión vehicular segura\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5 text-[10px] font-medium text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2\" data-name=\"mobile page context label\">\n            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-shield-check text-[16px] text-[#10B981]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"mobile shield check icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n            </i>\n            <span class=\"hidden min-[350px]:inline\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"mobile access protected label\">\n                Acceso protegido\n            </span>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <main class=\"mx-auto flex min-h-[calc(100vh-68px)] w-full max-w-[560px] items-start justify-center px-4 py-6 pb-28\" data-kid=\"2-2\" data-name=\"mobile pending approval content wrapper\">\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"pending-title\" class=\"w-full border border-[#CBD5E1] bg-white px-4 py-6 shadow-[0_12px_30px_rgba(15,23,42,0.06)]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1\" data-name=\"mobile pending approval panel\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"mobile pending status intro\">\n                <div class=\"grid size-[68px] place-items-center border-2 border-[#BFDBFE] bg-[#E8F2FD] text-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"mobile pending status icon wrapper\">\n                    <i aria-label=\"Solicitud en revisión\" class=\"ti ti-clock-hour-4 text-[32px]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"mobile clock hour icon\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-[#FCD34D] bg-[#FFFBEB] px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-[#92400E]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"mobile pending status badge\">\n                    <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"size-2 rounded-full bg-[#F59E0B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"mobile status indicator dot\">\n                    </span>\n                    Solicitud enviada\n                </div>\n                <h1 class=\"mt-5 font-heading text-[23px] font-extrabold leading-[1.16] tracking-[-0.045em] text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"mobile pending approval heading\" id=\"pending-title\">\n                    Tu taller está pendiente de aprobación\n                </h1>\n                <p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[300px] text-[14px] leading-5.5 text-[#475569]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-1-4\" data-name=\"mobile pending approval description\">\n                    Revisaremos la información y te avisaremos cuando puedas empezar a gestionar servicios.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-7 border-y border-[#E2E8F0] py-5\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"mobile approval progress section\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between text-left\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"mobile approval progress steps\">\n                    <div class=\"flex w-[62px] shrink-0 flex-col items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"mobile submitted step\">\n                        <div class=\"grid size-9 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#1E88E5] text-white\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"mobile submitted step marker\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-check text-[18px]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"mobile check icon\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                            </i>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-center text-[10px] font-semibold leading-4 text-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"mobile submitted step label\">\n                            Enviada\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-[18px] h-px flex-1 bg-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-1-4\" data-name=\"mobile submitted to in-review progress line\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex w-[70px] shrink-0 flex-col items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"mobile in review step\">\n                        <div class=\"grid size-9 place-items-center rounded-full border-2 border-[#F59E0B] bg-[#FFFBEB] text-[#B45309]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"mobile in review step marker\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-clock-hour-4 text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"mobile clock hour icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                            </i>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-center text-[10px] font-semibold leading-4 text-[#92400E]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"mobile in review step label\">\n                            En revisión\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-[18px] h-px flex-1 bg-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-1-6\" data-name=\"mobile in-review to approved progress line\">\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex w-[62px] shrink-0 flex-col items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"mobile approved step\">\n                        <div class=\"grid size-9 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[#CBD5E1] bg-[#F8FAFC] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"mobile approved step marker\">\n                            <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-shield-check text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"mobile shield check icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                            </i>\n                        </div>\n                        <span class=\"text-center text-[10px] font-semibold leading-4 text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"mobile approved step label\">\n                            Aprobada\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-[11px]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"mobile request metadata row\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"mobile request date label\">\n                        Fecha de solicitud\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"font-semibold tabular-nums text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2-2-2\" data-name=\"mobile request date value\">\n                        Enviada hoy\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-5 border-l-4 border-[#1E88E5] bg-[#F8FAFC] px-3.5 py-3\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"mobile approval reassurance note\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"mobile reassurance note content group\">\n                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-info-circle mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-[18px] text-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"mobile info circle icon\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                    <p class=\"text-[11px] leading-5 text-[#475569]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"mobile reassurance text\">\n                        Te notificaremos por correo y en la aplicación cuando cambie el estado de tu solicitud.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-6 flex flex-col gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-4\" data-name=\"mobile pending approval actions\">\n                <button aria-label=\"Verificar estado de aprobación\" class=\"inline-flex min-h-[52px] w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#522C81] to-[#46256F] px-5 py-3 text-[14px] font-bold text-white shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] transition duration-150 ease-out hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-[0_6px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.10)] active:scale-[0.97]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"mobile check approval status button\">\n                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-refresh text-[18px]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"mobile refresh icon\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                    Verificar estado\n                </button>\n                <button aria-label=\"Contactar soporte de AutoDoc\" class=\"inline-flex min-h-[52px] w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 border border-[#CBD5E1] bg-white px-5 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#1E293B] hover:border-[#1E88E5] hover:text-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-4-2\" data-name=\"mobile contact support button\">\n                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-headset text-[18px] text-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"mobile headset icon\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                    Contactar soporte\n                </button>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-5 flex justify-center\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-5\" data-name=\"mobile logout action\">\n                <button aria-label=\"Cerrar sesión\" class=\"inline-flex min-h-[48px] items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#64748B] hover:text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-5-1\" data-name=\"mobile sign out button\">\n                    <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ti ti-logout-2 text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-5-1-1\" data-name=\"mobile logout icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                    Cerrar sesión\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-08-17T20:18:16.149226+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-08-17T20:55:37.617682+00:00",
