      "html": "<link data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"Tabler icon stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont/tabler-icons.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@600;700;800&display=swap');\n  .font-heading { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; }\n  .font-body { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"font-body min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden bg-[#F8FAFC] text-[#0F172A] antialiased\" data-kid=\"2\" data-name=\"Mobile authentication page root\">\n    <header class=\"flex h-[76px] items-center justify-between border-b border-[#E2E8F0] bg-white px-4\" data-kid=\"2-1\" data-name=\"Mobile auth top bar\">\n        <div class=\"flex min-h-12 items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-1-1\" data-name=\"Mobile AutoDoc brand group\">\n            <div aria-label=\"AutoDoc\" class=\"grid size-9 place-items-center rounded-[10px] bg-[#1E88E5] text-[15px] font-heading font-extrabold tracking-[-0.08em] text-white\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"Mobile logo mark\">\n                AD\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"font-heading text-[16px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.04em]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"Mobile wordmark\">\n                AutoDoc\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <button aria-label=\"Cambiar idioma\" class=\"ml-auto flex min-h-12 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[#CBD5E1] bg-[#EEEDF0] px-4 text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#5B6B80] shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] transition duration-150 ease-out hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-[0_6px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.10)] active:scale-[0.97]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2\" data-name=\"language selector button\" type=\"button\">\n            <span class=\"text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"Language icon container\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-language\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"Language icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                </i>\n            </span>\n            ES\n            <span class=\"text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"Language chevron container\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-chevron-down\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Language chevron icon\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                </i>\n            </span>\n        </button>\n    </header>\n    <main class=\"px-4 pb-[calc(24px+env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] pt-5\" data-kid=\"2-2\" data-name=\"Mobile auth scroll content\">\n        <section class=\"relative min-h-[172px] overflow-hidden border border-[#334155] bg-[#0F172A] text-white\" data-kid=\"2-2-1\" data-name=\"Compact mobile brand panel\">\n            <img alt=\"Sedán moderno en un estudio oscuro, fotografía de Hyundai Motor Group en Pexels\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover opacity-40\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"Compact automotive brand image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://images.pexels.com/photos/14696345/pexels-photo-14696345.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=700&q=80\"/>\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#0F172A]/75 via-[#0F172A]/65 to-[#020617]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"Compact brand tonal overlay\">\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"relative flex min-h-[172px] flex-col justify-end px-4 py-4\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"Compact brand panel content\">\n                <div class=\"mb-2 flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#7DD3FC]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-3-1\" data-name=\"Brand eyebrow\">\n                    <span class=\"h-px w-6 bg-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"Eyebrow rule\">\n                    </span>\n                    Tu vehículo, en control\n                </div>\n                <h1 class=\"font-heading text-[23px] font-extrabold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.045em] text-white\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-3-2\" data-name=\"Mobile brand promise heading\">\n                    Mantenimiento claro.\n                    <br data-kid=\"2-2-1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"Mobile heading line break\"/>\n                    Decisiones seguras.\n                </h1>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"auth-heading\" class=\"mt-7 rounded-[16px] border border-[#CBD5E1]/40 bg-[#EEEDF0] p-5 shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2\" data-name=\"mobile login form content container\">\n            <div class=\"mb-7\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Mobile auth heading group\">\n                <div class=\"mb-3 flex items-center gap-2 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"Auth eyebrow\">\n                    <span class=\"size-2 rounded-full bg-[#10B981]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"Connection status dot\">\n                    </span>\n                    Acceso disponible\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"font-heading text-[28px] font-extrabold leading-[1.12] tracking-[-0.05em] text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"Auth heading\" id=\"auth-heading\">\n                    Bienvenido a AutoDoc\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] leading-6 text-[#475569]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"Auth description\">\n                    Accede para ver el estado de tus vehículos y tus servicios.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <form class=\"space-y-5\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"Mobile login form\">\n                <label class=\"block\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Email field group\">\n                    <span class=\"mb-2 block text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"Email field label\">\n                        Correo electrónico\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"flex min-h-14 items-center gap-3 border border-[#CBD5E1] bg-white px-4\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"Email field surface\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[19px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"Email icon container\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-mail\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"Email icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                        <input aria-label=\"Correo electrónico\" class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 border-0 bg-transparent text-[15px] text-[#0F172A] outline-hidden placeholder:text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"Email input\" placeholder=\"tu@correo.com\" type=\"email\" value=\"juan@ejemplo.com\"/>\n                    </span>\n                </label>\n                <label class=\"block\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"Password field group\">\n                    <span class=\"mb-2 block text-[13px] font-semibold text-[#0F172A]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Password field label\">\n                        Contraseña\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"flex min-h-14 items-center gap-3 border border-[#EF4444] bg-white px-4 ring-2 ring-[#EF4444]/10\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"Password field error surface\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[19px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"Password icon container\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-lock\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"Password icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                        <input aria-label=\"Contraseña\" class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 border-0 bg-transparent text-[15px] text-[#0F172A] outline-hidden placeholder:text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"Password input\" placeholder=\"Introduce tu contraseña\" type=\"password\" value=\"incorrecta\"/>\n                        <button aria-label=\"Mostrar contraseña\" class=\"grid size-12 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[#CBD5E1] bg-[#EEEDF0] text-[18px] text-[#5B6B80] shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] transition duration-150 ease-out hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-[0_6px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.10)] active:scale-[0.97]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"password visibility button\" type=\"button\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-eye\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"Password visibility icon\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                            </i>\n                        </button>\n                    </span>\n                </label>\n                <div class=\"flex min-h-12 items-center justify-between gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"Auth options row\">\n                    <label class=\"flex min-h-12 shrink-0 items-center gap-2 text-[13px] text-[#475569]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"Remember me option\">\n                        <input checked=\"\" class=\"size-4 accent-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"Remember me checkbox\" type=\"checkbox\"/>\n                        Recordarme\n                    </label>\n                    <button class=\"min-h-12 px-1 text-right text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#1E88E5] underline-offset-4\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"Forgot password button\" type=\"button\">\n                        ¿Olvidaste tu contraseña?\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 border-l-4 border-[#EF4444] bg-[#FEF2F2] px-4 py-3\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-4\" data-name=\"Inline authentication error\" role=\"alert\">\n                    <span class=\"mt-0.5 text-[19px] text-[#DC2626]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"Error icon container\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-alert-triangle\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"Error alert icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </span>\n                    <div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"Error copy group\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold text-[#991B1B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"Error title\">\n                            No pudimos iniciar sesión\n                        </p>\n                        <p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[12px] leading-5 text-[#7F1D1D]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"Error message\">\n                            Revisa tu correo y contraseña\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <button class=\"flex min-h-14 w-full items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#522C81] to-[#46246F] px-5 text-[14px] font-bold text-white shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] transition duration-150 ease-out hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-[0_6px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.10)] active:scale-[0.97]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-5\" data-name=\"primary login button with interactive states\" type=\"submit\">\n                    Iniciar sesión\n                    <span class=\"text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"Login arrow container\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-right\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"Login arrow icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                    </span>\n                </button>\n            </form>\n            <div class=\"my-7 flex items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"Auth divider\">\n                <span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-[#E2E8F0]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"Divider line left\">\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"Divider label\">\n                    o\n                </span>\n                <span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-[#E2E8F0]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-3-3\" data-name=\"Divider line right\">\n                </span>\n            </div>\n            <button class=\"flex min-h-14 w-full items-center justify-center gap-3 rounded-full border border-[#CBD5E1] bg-[#EEEDF0] px-5 text-[14px] font-semibold text-[#0F172A] shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.05)] transition duration-150 ease-out hover:scale-[1.02] hover:border-[#522C81] hover:shadow-[0_6px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.10)] active:scale-[0.97]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-4\" data-name=\"google sign in button with interactive styles\" type=\"button\">\n                <span class=\"text-[19px] text-[#4285F4]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"Google icon container\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-brand-google\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"Google icon\" style=\"width:19px;height:19px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                </span>\n                Continuar con Google\n            </button>\n            <p class=\"mt-8 text-center text-[13px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-5\" data-name=\"Auth mode switch copy\">\n                ¿No tienes cuenta?\n                <button class=\"ml-1 min-h-12 px-1 font-semibold text-[#1E88E5] underline-offset-4\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"Create account button\" type=\"button\">\n                    Crear cuenta\n                </button>\n            </p>\n            <p class=\"mt-7 text-center text-[11px] leading-5 text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-6\" data-name=\"Auth legal copy\">\n                Al continuar, aceptas los términos de uso y la política de privacidad de AutoDoc.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"mt-7 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-7\" data-name=\"Mobile protection statement\">\n                <span class=\"grid size-7 place-items-center border border-[#CBD5E1] text-[15px] text-[#1E88E5]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-7-1\" data-name=\"Protection icon container\">\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-shield-check\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-7-1-1\" data-name=\"Protection shield icon\" style=\"width:15px;height:15px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                    </i>\n                </span>\n                Datos de tu garaje protegidos\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-08-17T20:19:02.608009+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-08-17T21:04:21.400481+00:00",
      "id": "var_9556cc7c1c27"
    },
    "var_063f2a2ab3a4": {
      "type": "variant",
      "label": "AutoDoc Mechanic Pending — Hadrian Dark Mobile",
      "parentId": "var_103caf4f9759",
      "themeId": null,
      "rect": {
        "x": 75580,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 375,
        "h": 812
      },
      "html": "<link data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"google font and icon stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tabler/icons-webfont/tabler-icons.min.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\"/>\n<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@600;700;800&display=swap');\n  .font-heading { font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif; }\n  .font-body { font-family: 'IBM Plex Sans', sans-serif; }\n</style>\n<div class=\"font-body min-h-screen overflow-x-hidden bg-[#0F172A] text-[#F8FAFC] antialiased\" data-kid=\"2\" data-name=\"mobile mechanic pending state page\">\n    <header class=\"sticky top-0 z-20 flex min-h-[72px] items-center justify-between border-b border-[#334155] bg-[#020617] px-4\" data-kid=\"2-1\" data-name=\"compact mobile pending header\">\n        <div class=\"flex min-w-0 items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-1-1\" data-name=\"compact AutoDoc brand group\">\n            <div aria-label=\"AutoDoc\" class=\"grid size-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-[10px] bg-[#38BDF8] text-[17px] font-heading font-extrabold tracking-[-0.08em] text-[#082F49]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"AutoDoc logo mark\">\n                AD\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"brand text container\">\n                <div class=\"font-heading text-[16px] font-extrabold tracking-[-0.04em]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"AutoDoc wordmark\">\n                    Auto\n                    <span class=\"text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"AutoDoc wordmark suffix\">\n                        Doc\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"truncate text-[10px] font-medium text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"mobile screen context\">\n                    Estado de solicitud\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-1-2\" data-name=\"mobile workshop identity\">\n            <button aria-label=\"Contactar soporte\" class=\"grid min-h-11 min-w-11 place-items-center border border-[#475569] text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"mobile support button\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-headset text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"headset icon\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                </i>\n            </button>\n            <div class=\"grid size-9 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#334155] text-[11px] font-bold text-[#E2E8F0]\" data-kid=\"2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"workshop initials\">\n                TR\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <main class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1080px] px-4 pb-[calc(7.5rem+env(safe-area-inset-bottom))] pt-6\" data-kid=\"2-2\" data-name=\"mobile pending page main content\">\n        <div class=\"mb-5 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1\" data-name=\"mobile pending breadcrumb\">\n            <span data-kid=\"2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"breadcrumb path segment\">\n                Acceso de taller\n            </span>\n            <i class=\"ti ti-chevron-right text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"breadcrumb separator icon\" style=\"width:13px;height:13px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n            </i>\n            <span class=\"font-semibold text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"breadcrumb active page label\">\n                Estado de solicitud\n            </span>\n        </div>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"mobile-pending-title\" class=\"overflow-hidden border border-[#334155] bg-[#1E293B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2\" data-name=\"stacked mobile approval status panel\">\n            <div class=\"border-b border-[#334155] bg-[#111827] p-5\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"mobile approval status summary\">\n                <div aria-label=\"Solicitud pendiente, representada por un reloj junto a un escudo\" class=\"mb-6 flex size-[76px] items-center justify-center border border-[#38BDF8]/60 bg-[#0B2535] text-[32px] text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"pending shield clock icon\" role=\"img\">\n                    <span class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"icon grouping wrapper\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-shield-check\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"shield check icon\" style=\"width:32px;height:32px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                        <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute -bottom-1 -right-2 grid size-7 place-items-center border border-[#1E293B] bg-[#FBBF24] text-[14px] text-[#451A03]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-1-2\" data-name=\"clock badge container\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-clock\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"clock icon\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#FBBF24]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"submission status label\">\n                    Solicitud enviada\n                </p>\n                <h2 class=\"mt-3 font-heading text-[22px] font-bold leading-tight tracking-[-0.04em] text-[#F8FAFC]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"submission headline\">\n                    Estamos revisando tus datos.\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"mt-3 text-[13px] leading-6 text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-4\" data-name=\"submission descriptive text\">\n                    Tu taller ha sido registrado correctamente. Un administrador revisará la solicitud antes de habilitar el acceso operativo.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"mt-7 border-t border-[#334155] pt-4\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-5\" data-name=\"mobile submitted timestamp group\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-[12px]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-5-1\" data-name=\"submission timestamp row\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-5-1-1\" data-name=\"submission label\">\n                            Enviada\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"font-semibold tabular-nums text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-5-1-2\" data-name=\"submitted date time text\">\n                            Hoy · 09:42\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 text-[12px]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-5-2\" data-name=\"estimated timeframe row\">\n                        <span class=\"text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-5-2-1\" data-name=\"estimated timeframe label\">\n                            Tiempo estimado\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"text-right font-semibold text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-1-5-2-2\" data-name=\"estimated timeframe text\">\n                            1–2 días hábiles\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"p-5\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"mobile approval status details\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"mobile pending title row\">\n                    <div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"pending title group\">\n                        <p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"workshop registration label\">\n                            Registro de taller\n                        </p>\n                        <h1 class=\"mt-2 font-heading text-[27px] font-extrabold leading-[1.1] tracking-[-0.05em] text-[#F8FAFC]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"main status heading\" id=\"mobile-pending-title\">\n                            Tu taller está pendiente de aprobación\n                        </h1>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5 border border-[#FBBF24]/50 bg-[#3A2B0B] px-2 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-bold text-[#FCD34D]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"mobile pending state badge\">\n                        <span class=\"size-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#FBBF24]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"status indicator dot\">\n                        </span>\n                        Pendiente\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-[14px] leading-6 text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-2\" data-name=\"pending status descriptive paragraph\">\n                    Recibirás una notificación cuando un administrador termine la revisión. Mientras tanto, puedes cerrar sesión; tu solicitud seguirá guardada y no tendrás que repetir el registro.\n                </p>\n                <div class=\"mt-8\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3\" data-name=\"mobile approval progress section\">\n                    <div class=\"mb-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"progress section header\">\n                        <h2 class=\"font-heading text-[15px] font-bold text-[#F8FAFC]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"progress title\">\n                            Estado de la solicitud\n                        </h2>\n                        <span class=\"text-[11px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"submission date text\">\n                            Enviada hoy\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-4\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"stacked approval progress steps\">\n                        <div class=\"border-l-2 border-[#38BDF8] pl-3\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"submitted step\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"step indicator\">\n                                <span class=\"grid size-7 place-items-center bg-[#38BDF8] text-[12px] font-bold text-[#082F49]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"step number label\">\n                                    1\n                                </span>\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-check text-[15px] text-[#34D399]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"step complete checkmark icon\" style=\"width:15px;height:15px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n                                <span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#34D399]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-2-1-1-3\" data-name=\"step status label\">\n                                    Completada\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] font-bold text-[#F8FAFC]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"step title text\">\n                                Enviada\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-2-1-3\" data-name=\"step description text\">\n                                Solicitud recibida\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"border-l-2 border-[#FBBF24] pl-3\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"review step\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"step indicator\">\n                                <span class=\"grid size-7 place-items-center border border-[#FBBF24] bg-[#3A2B0B] text-[12px] font-bold text-[#FCD34D]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"step number label\">\n                                    2\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#FCD34D]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"step status label\">\n                                    En curso\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] font-bold text-[#F8FAFC]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"step title text\">\n                                En revisión\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-2-2-3\" data-name=\"step description text\">\n                                Validación administrativa\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"border-l-2 border-[#475569] pl-3\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-2-3\" data-name=\"approved step\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-2-3-1\" data-name=\"step indicator\">\n                                <span class=\"grid size-7 place-items-center border border-[#475569] text-[12px] font-bold text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"step number label\">\n                                    3\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"step status label\">\n                                    Pendiente\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] font-bold text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-2-3-2\" data-name=\"step title text\">\n                                Aprobada\n                            </p>\n                            <p class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-3-2-3-3\" data-name=\"step description text\">\n                                Acceso al panel del taller\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-8 border-y border-[#334155] py-5\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-4\" data-name=\"mobile pending information list\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-4-1\" data-name=\"email notification info row\">\n                        <span class=\"mt-0.5 text-[18px] text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-4-1-1\" data-name=\"email icon container\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-mail\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"email icon\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                        <p class=\"text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-4-1-2\" data-name=\"email info text\">\n                            Te avisaremos por correo cuando la revisión avance.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mt-4 flex items-start gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-4-2\" data-name=\"push notification info row\">\n                        <span class=\"mt-0.5 text-[18px] text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-4-2-1\" data-name=\"notification icon container\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-bell\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"notification bell icon\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                        <p class=\"text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-4-2-2\" data-name=\"push info text\">\n                            Recibirás una notificación push cuando tu cuenta sea aprobada.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"mt-4 flex items-start gap-3\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-4-3\" data-name=\"estimated time info row\">\n                        <span class=\"mt-0.5 text-[18px] text-[#FBBF24]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-4-3-1\" data-name=\"time info icon container\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-calendar-time\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-4-3-1-1\" data-name=\"calendar icon\" style=\"width:18px;height:18px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                        <p class=\"text-[13px] leading-5 text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-4-3-2\" data-name=\"time info text\">\n                            Tiempo estimado de aprobación:\n                            <strong class=\"font-semibold text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-4-3-2-1\" data-name=\"estimated days text\">\n                                1–2 días hábiles\n                            </strong>\n                            .\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-7 rounded-[2px] border border-[#475569] bg-[#162235] px-4 py-3\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-5\" data-name=\"mobile support hint\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"support hint content\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-headset text-[16px] text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-2-2-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"headset icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                        </i>\n                        ¿Necesitas ayuda?\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <footer class=\"mt-6 flex flex-col gap-2 border-t border-[#334155] pt-5 text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"2-2-3\" data-name=\"mobile pending page footer\">\n            <span data-kid=\"2-2-3-1\" data-name=\"copyright/description text\">\n                AutoDoc · Gestión operativa para talleres\n            </span>\n            <span class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"2-2-3-2\" data-name=\"security status row\">\n                <span class=\"size-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]\" data-kid=\"2-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"security status dot\">\n                </span>\n                Tu solicitud está guardada de forma segura\n            </span>\n        </footer>\n    </main>\n    <nav aria-label=\"Acciones de estado de solicitud\" class=\"fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0 z-30 border-t border-[#334155] bg-[#020617]/95 px-2 pb-[env(safe-area-inset-bottom)] pt-2 backdrop-blur-sm\" data-kid=\"2-3\" data-name=\"fixed mobile pending action navigation\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-[420px] items-stretch gap-1\" data-kid=\"2-3-1\" data-name=\"navigation action group\">\n            <button class=\"flex min-h-12 min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-[#81E6D9] to-[#6FC8BC] px-1 text-[#0F172A] shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.2)] transition duration-150 ease-out hover:scale-[1.02] hover:shadow-[0_6px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.35)] active:scale-[0.97]\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"mobile check approval button\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-refresh text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"refresh icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                </i>\n                <span class=\"truncate text-[10px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"button text\">\n                    Verificar estado\n                </span>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"flex min-h-12 min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 border border-[#475569] px-1 text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"mobile support action button\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-headset text-[16px] text-[#38BDF8]\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"headset icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                </i>\n                <span class=\"truncate text-[10px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-2-2\" data-name=\"button text\">\n                    Contactar soporte\n                </span>\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"flex min-h-12 min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col items-center justify-center gap-0.5 px-1 text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-3\" data-name=\"mobile logout button\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-logout text-[16px]\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-3-1\" data-name=\"logout icon\" style=\"width:16px;height:16px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                </i>\n                <span class=\"truncate text-[10px] font-semibold\" data-kid=\"2-3-1-3-2\" data-name=\"button text\">\n                    Cerrar sesión\n                </span>\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n</div>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-08-17T20:19:09.754869+00:00",
