                     SUSPENDER USUARIO\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-4-1-2-2\">\n                                    Seguridad\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"text-[12px] leading-5 text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-4-2\">\n                            Bloqueó una cuenta por actividad sospechosa.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"text-[12px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-4-3\">\n                            <div class=\"font-semibold text-[#E2E8F0]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-4-3-1\">\n                                Usuarios\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 font-mono text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-4-3-2\">\n                                usr_72af01\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <time class=\"text-right text-[11px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-4-4\">\n                            15/08/26\n                            <br data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-4-4-1\"/>\n                            <span class=\"font-semibold text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-4-4-2\">\n                                07:58\n                            </span>\n                        </time>\n                    </article>\n                    <article class=\"grid grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.05fr)_minmax(0,1.35fr)_minmax(0,1.6fr)_120px] items-center gap-5 border-b border-[#334155] px-5 py-5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-5\" data-name=\"reject workshop log entry\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-5-1\">\n                            <span class=\"flex size-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#3F1D25] text-[#F87171]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-5-1-1\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-ban\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-5-1-1-1\" style=\"width:17px;height:17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n                            </span>\n                            <div data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-5-1-2\">\n                                <div class=\"text-[12px] font-bold text-[#F87171]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-5-1-2-1\">\n                                    RECHAZAR TALLER\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"mt-1 text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-5-1-2-2\">\n                                    Superadmin\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"text-[12px] leading-5 text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-5-2\">\n                            Rechazó una solicitud por documentación incompleta.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"text-[12px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-5-3\">\n                            <div class=\"font-semibold text-[#E2E8F0]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-5-3-1\">\n                                Talleres\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-1 font-mono text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-5-3-2\">\n                                taller_29de11\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <time class=\"text-right text-[11px] text-[#94A3B8]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-5-4\">\n                            14/08/26\n                            <br data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-5-4-1\"/>\n                            <span class=\"font-semibold text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-5-4-2\">\n                                17:26\n                            </span>\n                        </time>\n                    </article>\n                    <article class=\"grid grid-cols-