"1-1-3-2-4-6-4\">\n                            14/08/26\n                            <br data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-6-4-1\"/>\n                            <span class=\"font-semibold text-[#CBD5E1]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-6-4-2\">\n                                16:09\n                            </span>\n                        </time>\n                    </article>\n                </section>\n                <p class=\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-[#64748B]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-5\" data-name=\"last sync timestamp text\" data-reason=\"text updated to show elapsed time since sync\">\n                    <span class=\"size-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-5-1\">\n                    </span>\n                    Datos sincronizados hace 2 min · Registro protegido para auditoría.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
