ustify-between gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-1\" data-name=\"audit record header\">\n                            <div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"audit record header text\">\n                                <p class=\"text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.11em] text-[var(--success)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"record type label\">\n                                    APROBAR TALLER\n                                </p>\n                                <p class=\"mt-1 text-[13px] font-bold leading-5 text-[var(--text-primary)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"record action description\">\n                                    Aprobó el registro de Taller Rápido\n                                </p>\n                            </div>\n                            <time class=\"shrink-0 text-[10px] text-[var(--text-secondary)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"record timestamp\">\n                                17/08/26 · 08:42\n                            </time>\n                        </div>\n                        <p class=\"mt-2 text-[12px] leading-5 text-[var(--text-secondary)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-2\" data-name=\"record detail body text\">\n                            La solicitud del taller quedó habilitada para operar en la plataforma.\n                        </p>\n                        <div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-3\" data-name=\"record tags container\">\n                            <span class=\"rounded-full bg-[var(--surface-variant)] px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-semibold text-[var(--text-secondary)]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"record category tag\">\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-category text-[11px]\" data-kid=\"1-2-4-1-1-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"category icon\" style=\"width:11px;height:11px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n              