                    Rechazar\n                                    </button>\n                                    <button aria-label=\"Aprobar Taller Rápido; requiere confirmación\" class=\"flex min-h-[44px] items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--success)] px-3 text-[11px] font-bold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-3-1-3-2-2\">\n                                        <i class=\"ti ti-check\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-3-1-3-2-2-1\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                        </i>\n                                        Aprobar\n                                    </button>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </article>\n                        <article class=\"rounded-[16px] border border-[var(--outline)] bg-[var(--surface-container)] p-4 shadow-[0_2px_4px_rgba(15,23,42,0.05)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-3-2\" data-name=\"workshop admin card approved\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-3-2-1\">\n                                <div data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-3-2-1-1\">\n                                    <h3 class=\"font-heading text-[18px] font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-3-2-1-1-1\">\n                                        MotorLab\n                                    </h3>\n                                    <div class=\"mt-2 flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-3-2-1-1-2\">\n                                        <span class=\"rounded-full bg-[var(--success-surface)] px-2.5 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-[var(--success)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-3-2-1-1-2-1\">\n                                            APROBADO\n                                        </span>\n                                        <span class=\"text-[12px] text-[var(--text-secondary)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-3-2-1-1-2-2\">\n                                            Operando\n                                        </span>\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <i class=\"ti ti-building-store text-[22px] text-[var(--primary)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-3-2-1-2\" style=\"width:22px;height:22px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                </i>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[12px] text-[var(--text-secondary)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-3-2-2\">\n                                <span class=\"rounded-full bg-white px-2.5 py-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-3-2-2-1\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-tool text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-3-2-2-1-1\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    Mecánica general\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"rounded-full bg-white px-2.5 py-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-3-2-2-2\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-map-pin text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-3-2-2-2-1\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    Santa Ana\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"rounded-full bg-white px-2.5 py-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-3-2-2-3\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-phone text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-3-2-2-3-1\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    2440-1099\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-4 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-t border-[var(--outline)] pt-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-3-2-3\">\n                                <span class=\"text-[11px] text-[var(--text-secondary)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-3-2-3-1\">\n                                    Estado operativo\n                                </span>\n                                <button aria-label=\"Suspender MotorLab; requiere confirmación\" class=\"flex min-h-[44px] items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-[var(--error)] bg-[var(--error-surface)] px-3 text-[11px] font-bold text-[var(--error)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-3-2-3-2\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-ban\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-4-3-2-3-2-1\" style=\"width:14px;height:14px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    Suspender\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                        </article>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n                <p class=\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 pb-2 text-[11px] text-[var(--text-secondary)]\" data-dynamic=\"true\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-5\" data-name=\"sync timestamp text\" data-reason=\"timestamp updated every minute by script\">\n                    <span class=\"size-1.5 rounded-full bg-[var(--success)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-5-1\">\n                    </span>\n                    Datos sincronizados hace 4 min · Cambios administrativos requieren confirmación.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
