                              <p class=\"truncate text-[11px] text-[var(--text-secondary)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-3-2-3-1-2-2\">\n                                        diego@centroauto.com\n                                    </p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-3-2-3-2\">\n                                <span class=\"rounded-[8px] bg-[var(--secondary)]/35 px-2 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold text-[var(--text-primary)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-3-2-3-2-1\">\n                                    Taller\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"rounded-[8px] bg-[var(--warning-surface)] px-2 py-1 text-[10px] font-bold text-[var(--warning)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-3-2-3-2-2\">\n                                    pendiente\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3 border-t border-[var(--outline)] pt-3 text-[11px] text-[var(--text-secondary)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-3-2-3-3\">\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-3-2-3-3-1\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-tool text-[13px] text-[var(--primary)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-3-2-3-3-1-1\" style=\"width:13px;height:13px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    General\n                                </span>\n                                <span data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-3-2-3-3-2\">\n                                    <i class=\"ti ti-map-pin text-[13px] text-[var(--primary)]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-3-2-3-3-2-1\" style=\"width:13px;height:13px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\">\n                                    </i>\n                                    Soyapango\n                                </span